177
00:10:23,125 --> 00:10:25,208
<font size="20">Nola gure alde dagoela?</font>

178
00:10:25,291 --> 00:10:29,583
<font size="20">Diotenez, Ian Venthamek
gainetik kendu nahi du Coopers Chase.</font>

179
00:10:30,375 --> 00:10:32,416
<font size="20">Zer? Zergatik?</font>

180
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:35,333
<font size="20">Luxuzko pisuak egiteko.
Bota egin nahi gaitu.</font>

181
00:10:35,416 --> 00:10:37,375
<font size="20">Baina ni heldu berria naiz.</font>

182
00:10:37,458 --> 00:10:41,833
<font size="20">Baina Tonyk ez du onartuko, ezta?
Ez izeba Maud bizirik dagoen bitartean.</font>

183
00:10:41,916 --> 00:10:44,875
<font size="20">Beraz, Tony Curran
oso garrantzitsua da guretzat.</font>

184
00:10:46,125 --> 00:10:47,458
<font size="20">Eta izeba Maud ere.</font>

185
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,541
<font size="20">- Tarta jan dezakegu?
- Bai.</font>

186
00:10:56,625 --> 00:11:00,875
<font size="20">Ostegunetako Hilketen Klubak
aspalditik behar du aditu mediko bat.</font>

187
00:11:00,958 --> 00:11:05,875
<font size="20">Horregatik nahi dugu bat egin dezazun,
baina, e, aldi baterako.</font>

188
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:08,083
<font size="20">Dibertigarria dirudi.</font>

189
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:12,625
<font size="20">Tarta egundokoa da, Joyce.
Honetara ohitu ninteke, bai.</font>

190
00:11:12,708 --> 00:11:16,750
<font size="20">Ez zaitez gehiegi ohitu, Ron.
Emaiezu aukera bat estatinei.</font>

191
00:11:16,833 --> 00:11:19,000
<font size="20">Baina tarta guztiz bikaina da.</font>

192
00:11:19,083 --> 00:11:21,500
<font size="20">- Hori onartuko dizut.
- Eskerrik asko.</font>

193
00:11:21,583 --> 00:11:25,500
<font size="20">Alabarentzat egin dut, baina dirudienez
perimenopausiko dago eta ezin du jan.</font>

194
00:11:25,583 --> 00:11:30,208
<font size="20">Mesedez, utzi tarta alde batera
eta adi egon zaitezte unetxo batez.</font>

195
00:11:30,291 --> 00:11:31,750
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Bai?</font>

196
00:11:34,458 --> 00:11:37,250
<font size="20">Ikusi duzun neska hilaren argazkia</font>

197
00:11:37,333 --> 00:11:40,041
<font size="20">orain daukagun kasu irekikoa da.</font>

198
00:11:40,125 --> 00:11:43,750
<font size="20">Angela Hughes, "leihotik erori zen
zurizko emakumearen kasua".</font>

199
00:11:44,750 --> 00:11:45,583
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

200
00:11:46,125 --> 00:11:49,333
<font size="20">Polizia-txostenaren arabera,
Angelaren mutil-lagun Peter Mercer</font>

201
00:11:49,416 --> 00:11:52,041
<font size="20">galdekatu zuten
eta laster aske utzi zuten.</font>

202
00:11:52,125 --> 00:11:56,291
<font size="20">Gazte jatorra iruditu zitzaien
eta sarkinaren istorioa sinetsi zuten.</font>

203
00:11:56,375 --> 00:12:00,333
<font size="20">Dena dela, agente batek,
Penny Gray inspektoreak,</font>

204
00:12:00,416 --> 00:12:02,708
<font size="20">garaiko emakumezko polizia bakarrak,</font>

205
00:12:02,791 --> 00:12:06,125
<font size="20">berriz galdekatu zuen, baina ukatu zioten.</font>

206
00:12:06,208 --> 00:12:08,375
<font size="20">Gizonek bat egin zuten</font>

207
00:12:08,458 --> 00:12:10,291
<font size="20">eta dakigun hurrengoa da</font>

208
00:12:10,375 --> 00:12:13,250
<font size="20">Peter desagertu zela
eta ez zutela berriz ikusi.</font>

209
00:12:13,333 --> 00:12:14,541
<font size="20">Kasu itxia.</font>

210
00:12:15,125 --> 00:12:16,041
<font size="20">Orain arte.</font>

211
00:12:16,625 --> 00:12:19,166
<font size="20">Bide batez, nondik atera dituzue kasuak?</font>

212
00:12:19,250 --> 00:12:22,083
<font size="20">Dokumentu hauek guztiak
isilpekoak izango ziren.</font>

213
00:12:22,166 --> 00:12:26,458
<font size="20">Ba, zera, taldeko beste sortzaileak
eskuratu zituen,</font>

214
00:12:26,541 --> 00:12:29,291
<font size="20">Pennyk, nire lagun-minak.</font>

215
00:12:29,375 --> 00:12:34,166
<font size="20">A, Penny Gray inspektorea,
Peter Mercer birgaldekatu nahi zuena.</font>

216
00:12:34,250 --> 00:12:35,833
<font size="20">Hain zuzen ere.</font>

217
00:12:35,916 --> 00:12:38,833
<font size="20">Hau zirrara. Hurrengo astean etorriko da?</font>

218
00:12:40,458 --> 00:12:42,125
<font size="20">Ez, ez da etorriko.</font>

219
00:12:43,083 --> 00:12:45,208
<font size="20">Penny hospizio-hegalean dago.</font>

220
00:12:51,333 --> 00:12:52,375
<font size="20">Sentitzen dut.</font>

221
00:12:53,416 --> 00:12:54,250
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

222
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:59,791
<font size="20">Egunean jarri nahi zaitut
gure azken kasu irekiaren inguruan.</font>

223
00:12:59,875 --> 00:13:02,041
<font size="20">Ibrahim tematu da deitzean</font>

224
00:13:02,125 --> 00:13:05,208
<font size="20">"leihotik erori zen
zurizko emakumearen kasua".</font>

225
00:13:05,708 --> 00:13:07,791
<font size="20">Benetan? Gogoraerraza.</font>

226
00:13:08,541 --> 00:13:10,416
<font size="20">Baina nahasia da.</font>

227
00:13:10,916 --> 00:13:12,166
<font size="20">Gustatuko litzaizuke.</font>

228
00:13:13,208 --> 00:13:17,000
<font size="20">Gakoa da zenbat denbora
behar izan zuen neskak odolusteko.</font>

229
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:19,125
<font size="20">Baina zortea izan dugu.</font>

230
00:13:19,625 --> 00:13:22,541
<font size="20">- Zortea?
- Bai. Laguntzaile sutsu bat.</font>

231
00:13:22,625 --> 00:13:25,583
<font size="20">Heldu berri den erizain ohia, Joyce.</font>

232
00:13:25,666 --> 00:13:29,041
<font size="20">Nahiko atsegina, pixka bat xaloa akaso.</font>

233
00:13:29,125 --> 00:13:32,291
<font size="20">Baina, tira, aditua da labana-zaurietan.</font>

234
00:13:32,375 --> 00:13:34,375
<font size="20">Baliotsuak gara denok.</font>

235
00:13:34,458 --> 00:13:38,125
<font size="20">A, Penny, kasu honekin lagunduko bazenigu.</font>

236
00:13:38,208 --> 00:13:42,416
<font size="20">Oso ona da.
Nolatan ez zenuen zuk zeuk iradoki?</font>

237
00:13:47,458 --> 00:13:49,625
<font size="20">John, uste duzu entzun diezagukeela?</font>

238
00:13:51,375 --> 00:13:53,333
<font size="20">Batzuetan otoitz egiten dut entzuteko,</font>

239
00:13:54,416 --> 00:13:56,583
<font size="20">eta beste batzuetan ez egiteko.</font>

240
00:13:56,666 --> 00:13:58,333
<font size="20">Irakurtzen diot badaezpada.</font>

241
00:13:59,166 --> 00:14:01,875
<font size="20">- Hilketa-eleberri pila bat, ezta?
- Jakina.</font>

242
00:14:01,958 --> 00:14:05,875
<font size="20">Izugarri aspertuta zegoen
zu hona aldatu zinen arte.</font>

243
00:14:05,958 --> 00:14:08,541
<font size="20">Ostegunetako Hilketen Klubak
ondo egin zion.</font>

244
00:14:09,416 --> 00:14:11,000
<font size="20">Egundokoak zineten.</font>

245
00:14:14,625 --> 00:14:15,708
<font size="20">Zer moduz Stephen?</font>

246
00:14:16,666 --> 00:14:17,666
<font size="20">A, badakizu.</font>

247
00:14:19,750 --> 00:14:22,958
<font size="20">Bere dementzia-mota aldapan behera doa.</font>

248
00:14:23,041 --> 00:14:24,875
<font size="20">Eta ez da hobetuko.</font>

249
00:14:24,958 --> 00:14:26,750
<font size="20">Egun onak eta txarrak dauzka.</font>

250
00:14:26,833 --> 00:14:31,875
<font size="20">Eta batzuetan maite dudan Stephen da.
Argia, bere baitan.</font>

251
00:14:32,750 --> 00:14:35,250
<font size="20">Eta buelta ematean berriz joan zait.</font>

252
00:14:36,625 --> 00:14:37,458
<font size="20">Guztiz.</font>

253
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:40,916
<font size="20">Gozatu une onez.</font>

254
00:14:45,041 --> 00:14:47,458
<font size="20">- Stephen, bueltan nago.
- Kaixo, maitea.</font>

255
00:14:48,125 --> 00:14:49,375
<font size="20">Egun ona izan duzu?</font>

256
00:14:49,458 --> 00:14:51,875
<font size="20">Bai, eskerrik asko. Eta zuk?</font>

257
00:14:52,458 --> 00:14:53,291
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

258
00:14:53,833 --> 00:14:56,541
<font size="20">- Andreak bazkaria ekarri dit.
- Zer izan da?</font>

259
00:14:58,041 --> 00:14:59,208
<font size="20">Ene maitea.</font>

260
00:15:00,041 --> 00:15:01,083
<font size="20">Ahaztu zait. E…</font>

261
00:15:01,916 --> 00:15:05,000
<font size="20">Dena dela, gozo-gozoa zegoen.</font>

262
00:15:05,083 --> 00:15:09,000
<font size="20">Gaur bazkaltzeko, oilasko-pastela
porruekin eta patata egosiekin.</font>

263
00:15:10,125 --> 00:15:11,000
<font size="20">Gozo-gozoa.</font>

264
00:15:11,083 --> 00:15:12,291
<font size="20">Itxura bikaina.</font>

265
00:15:12,375 --> 00:15:14,708
<font size="20">- Zer irakurtzen ari zara?
- Ba lehen…</font>

266
00:15:16,125 --> 00:15:21,125
<font size="20">lorategira begira
mika bat ikusi dut, bat bakarrik.</font>

267
00:15:21,916 --> 00:15:27,791
<font size="20">Eta kezkatu naiz. Beraz, bilatu dut
eta badakizu betiko parekatzen direla?</font>

268
00:15:28,458 --> 00:15:29,625
<font size="20">Ez al da ederra?</font>

269
00:15:30,375 --> 00:15:31,333
<font size="20">Gu bezala.</font>

270
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:40,541
<font size="20">Ene, a ze berandu den.
Berandu nabil, bilera dut editorearekin.</font>

271
00:15:40,625 --> 00:15:41,916
<font size="20">- Ez, lasai.
- Zer?</font>

272
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:45,083
<font size="20">Ez larritu.
Katilukada bat te egingo dizut, e?</font>

273
00:15:45,166 --> 00:15:48,208
<font size="20">- Eta gero siestatxo bat.
- Bai, bikain.</font>

274
00:16:24,416 --> 00:16:25,750
<font size="20">Kaixo guztioi. E…</font>

275
00:16:26,958 --> 00:16:28,291
<font size="20">Barka berandutzea. E…</font>

276
00:16:29,125 --> 00:16:33,625
<font size="20">Donna de Freitas agentea naiz,
Fairhaveneko komisariakoa.</font>

277
00:16:34,208 --> 00:16:39,750
<font size="20">Etxe-segurtasunerako aholku praktikoak
ematera nator.</font>

278
00:16:39,833 --> 00:16:41,625
<font size="20">Benetako polizia zara?</font>

279
00:16:42,333 --> 00:16:46,041
<font size="20">Jakina benetako polizia dela, Marjorie.
Ondo portatu.</font>

280
00:16:46,125 --> 00:16:49,666
<font size="20">Bai, hala da, benetako polizia naiz.</font>

281
00:16:50,208 --> 00:16:53,041
<font size="20">Primeran.
Ba nik galdera bat dut, galdera on bat.</font>

282
00:16:53,125 --> 00:16:54,375
<font size="20">- Esan.
- Bale.</font>

283
00:16:55,041 --> 00:16:58,875
<font size="20">Gizon bat desagertzen bada
neska-laguna hil eta gero,</font>

284
00:16:58,958 --> 00:17:00,916
<font size="20">zenbat itxarongo zenukete</font>

285
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,583
<font size="20">desagertutzat jotzeko?</font>

286
00:17:07,958 --> 00:17:09,708
<font size="20">E…</font>

287
00:17:10,958 --> 00:17:14,791
<font size="20">Ez dut ulertzen zer lotura duen
etxeko segurtasunarekin.</font>

288
00:17:16,458 --> 00:17:21,166
<font size="20">Guztiok espero dugu hau ez izatea
sarrailei buruzko hitzaldi aspergarria.</font>

289
00:17:22,166 --> 00:17:24,375
<font size="20">Bai, badakigu agiria eskatzearena.</font>

290
00:17:24,458 --> 00:17:28,208
<font size="20">"Benetan zatoz gas-konpainiaren partetik
edo lapurra al zara?".</font>

291
00:17:29,833 --> 00:17:30,666
<font size="20">Noski.</font>

292
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,250
<font size="20">Nik sartzen utziko nioke.</font>

293
00:17:32,750 --> 00:17:34,500
<font size="20">Bisita eskertuko nuke.</font>

294
00:17:40,416 --> 00:17:43,208
<font size="20">Ba, egiatan, hitz egin nahi dizuet</font>

295
00:17:44,125 --> 00:17:46,416
<font size="20">telelaguntza botoiaz.</font>

296
00:17:52,625 --> 00:17:54,041
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

297
00:17:54,750 --> 00:17:55,583
<font size="20">Ez!</font>

298
00:17:56,958 --> 00:17:58,916
<font size="20">- Nire autoa da.
- Sentitzen dut.</font>

299
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:02,458
<font size="20">Aparkaleku-batzordeak
oso serio hartzen ditu zereginak.</font>

300
00:18:02,541 --> 00:18:05,125
<font size="20">- Faxista hutsak.
- Ezin dute egin, polizia naiz.</font>

301
00:18:05,208 --> 00:18:07,583
<font size="20">Erregea bazina ere, bost axola.</font>

302
00:18:07,666 --> 00:18:11,500
<font size="20">Bai, gutxienez ordu bat
geratuko zara hemen.</font>

303
00:18:14,541 --> 00:18:16,666
<font size="20">Gurekin bazkaldu nahi duzu?</font>

304
00:18:19,208 --> 00:18:21,416
<font size="20">- Botila bana eskatuko dugu?
- Noski.</font>

305
00:18:21,500 --> 00:18:24,500
<font size="20">- Botila bana zer?
- Ardo. Gorria eta zuria.</font>

306
00:18:24,583 --> 00:18:26,583
<font size="20">Zera, niretzat garaizegi da.</font>

307
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:30,041
<font size="20">A, ez da garaiz
bost eta erdietatik esna bazabiltza.</font>

308
00:18:30,125 --> 00:18:31,541
<font size="20">Ezetz asmatu nire adina.</font>

309
00:18:33,208 --> 00:18:34,541
<font size="20">Hirurogeita hemezortzi?</font>

310
00:18:34,625 --> 00:18:37,000
<font size="20">- Baina ez dirudi.
- Pilates egiten dut.</font>

311
00:18:37,083 --> 00:18:40,291
<font size="20">Itxuragatik, 65 esango nuke askoz jota,</font>

312
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:43,166
<font size="20">baina eskuetan beti nabaritzen da.</font>

313
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:44,875
<font size="20">A, polizia-lan ona, bai.</font>

314
00:18:44,958 --> 00:18:48,083
<font size="20">Esan, De Freitas agentea,
zeure lehen lana da?</font>

315
00:18:48,166 --> 00:18:52,208
<font size="20">Ez, Londreseko Polizia Metropolitanoan
ibili nintzen,</font>

316
00:18:52,291 --> 00:18:54,458
<font size="20">eta gero hona aldatu egin nintzen.</font>

317
00:18:54,541 --> 00:18:56,916
<font size="20">Eta gustatzen zaizu? Aspertzen zaitu?</font>

318
00:18:59,666 --> 00:19:01,833
<font size="20">Lasai. Gurekin salbu zaude.</font>

319
00:19:03,250 --> 00:19:04,083
<font size="20">Tira, ba.</font>

320
00:19:05,166 --> 00:19:09,833
<font size="20">Bai, bai, gogaituta nago
egun osoa trafiko-isunak jartzen emateaz.</font>

321
00:19:12,583 --> 00:19:14,791
<font size="20">Esan, ezkongabe zaudete? Ezkonduta?</font>

322
00:19:14,875 --> 00:19:16,250
<font size="20">Betiereko ezkongabea.</font>

323
00:19:16,916 --> 00:19:18,458
<font size="20">Dibortziatuta. Birritan.</font>

324
00:19:20,666 --> 00:19:21,500
<font size="20">Alarguna.</font>

325
00:19:22,416 --> 00:19:25,666
<font size="20">Baina Elizabeth ezkonduta dago
Stephen zoragarriarekin.</font>

326
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:28,416
<font size="20">Benetan? Bazkaltzera etorriko da?</font>

327
00:19:29,083 --> 00:19:30,833
<font size="20">Ez, erloju kontra dabil.</font>

328
00:19:30,916 --> 00:19:32,666
<font size="20">Stephen idazlea da.</font>

329
00:19:32,750 --> 00:19:35,833
<font size="20">Benetan?
Eta zer zenbiltzaten erretiratu aurretik?</font>

330
00:19:35,916 --> 00:19:39,500
<font size="20">Psikiatra. Gerra-beteranoen
trauma osteko estresean espezializatuta.</font>

331
00:19:39,583 --> 00:19:41,708
<font size="20">Eta zu, Ron?</font>

332
00:19:42,416 --> 00:19:43,916
<font size="20">A, ni sindikalista.</font>

333
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:47,083
<font size="20">Ez edozein sindikalista, Ron.</font>

334
00:19:47,166 --> 00:19:51,375
<font size="20">Bikaina zen.
Garaian Ron Gorria deitzen zioten.</font>

335
00:19:51,458 --> 00:19:55,833
<font size="20">Bai, bai, egia da.
Edozein piketetan, grebatan, eserialditan</font>

336
00:19:55,916 --> 00:19:58,875
<font size="20">han nengoen ni hitzez adoretzen,
jendea animatzen.</font>

337
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:01,375
<font size="20">Egun ederrak, bai.</font>

338
00:20:02,541 --> 00:20:03,791
<font size="20">Eta zu, Joyce?</font>

339
00:20:03,875 --> 00:20:05,625
<font size="20">Ezer berezirik ez.</font>

340
00:20:05,708 --> 00:20:08,291
<font size="20">Erizaina, gero ama, gero erizaina berriro.</font>

341
00:20:08,375 --> 00:20:11,541
<font size="20">Nire alaba, Joanna,
familiako interesgarriena da.</font>

342
00:20:11,625 --> 00:20:14,750
<font size="20">Estaldura funtsa bateko zuzendaria,
badakizue zer den?</font>

343
00:20:14,833 --> 00:20:15,833
<font size="20">- Ez.
- Batere ez.</font>

344
00:20:15,916 --> 00:20:16,833
<font size="20">Ezta nik ere.</font>

345
00:20:17,750 --> 00:20:18,875
<font size="20">Eta zu, Elizabeth?</font>

346
00:20:19,458 --> 00:20:20,541
<font size="20">Zertan zenbiltzan?</font>

347
00:20:22,833 --> 00:20:24,166
<font size="20">Nazioarteko gaiak.</font>

348
00:20:24,250 --> 00:20:26,875
<font size="20">Diplomatiko moduan?</font>

349
00:20:29,375 --> 00:20:32,291
<font size="20">Nahikoa da esatea
hainbat gaitasun dauzkadala.</font>

350
00:20:32,375 --> 00:20:34,416
<font size="20">- Barka.
- A, ardoa, eskerrik asko.</font>

351
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:38,750
<font size="20">Pixka bat hartuko dut.
Tira, zer daukagu gaur? Ikus dezagun.</font>

352
00:20:38,833 --> 00:20:41,000
<font size="20">- Zugatik eskatuko dut.
- Benetan?</font>

353
00:20:41,083 --> 00:20:42,583
