709
00:41:30,791 --> 00:41:31,666
<font size="20">Barka.</font>

710
00:41:31,750 --> 00:41:34,041
<font size="20">Ez da egokia "bai, mesedez" esatea?</font>

711
00:41:34,125 --> 00:41:36,458
<font size="20">Ez niri galdetu zer den egokia.</font>

712
00:41:36,541 --> 00:41:38,541
<font size="20">Tira, tori argazkia, De Freitas.</font>

713
00:41:39,333 --> 00:41:42,375
<font size="20">Deitu iezadazu Donna. Bestela arraroa da.</font>

714
00:41:43,500 --> 00:41:44,333
<font size="20">Donna?</font>

715
00:41:45,250 --> 00:41:46,083
<font size="20">Nire izena.</font>

716
00:41:47,500 --> 00:41:48,500
<font size="20">Nire ponte-izena.</font>

717
00:41:49,125 --> 00:41:54,375
