725
00:42:10,708 --> 00:42:13,833
<font size="20">Londreseko poliziak
aspalditik darama bere atzetik.</font>

726
00:42:14,333 --> 00:42:15,333
<font size="20">Eta hemen dago.</font>

727
00:42:15,916 --> 00:42:16,958
<font size="20">A ze ironikoa.</font>

728
00:42:17,041 --> 00:42:21,333
<font size="20">- Beraz, Londresen ez zuten aurkitu?
