736
00:42:38,333 --> 00:42:39,750
<font size="20">Ahalik eta beroen.</font>

737
00:42:44,541 --> 00:42:46,083
<font size="20">Heldu dira. Prest?</font>

738
00:42:46,166 --> 00:42:47,000
<font size="20">- Prest.
- Prest.</font>

739
00:42:47,083 --> 00:42:48,375
<font size="20">- Gogoratu.
- Egin lekua.</font>

740
00:42:48,458 --> 00:42:51,458
