773
00:44:34,416 --> 00:44:36,500
<font size="20">Jarri eroso. Hori da.</font>

774
00:44:36,583 --> 00:44:38,208
<font size="20">Jarri eroso, bai horixe.</font>

775
00:44:41,208 --> 00:44:43,958
<font size="20">- Ez al du bero egiten hemen?
