797
00:45:47,291 --> 00:45:49,666
<font size="20">Horren nahia omen da gaitz ororen erroa.</font>

798
00:45:49,750 --> 00:45:51,375
<font size="20">Baina ez zuen Jungek esan.</font>

799
00:45:51,458 --> 00:45:56,041
