883
00:50:12,291 --> 00:50:15,500
<font size="20">E, itxaron. Itxaron, Jason.</font>

884
00:50:15,583 --> 00:50:19,541
<font size="20">Inspektoreburua, tarta gustatzen zaizunez,
sobratu dena eman nahi dizut.</font>

885
00:50:19,625 --> 00:50:23,666
<font size="20">Agian hobe da Donnak gidatzen badu.
Ron pila bat dauka.</font>

886
00:50:23,750 --> 00:50:26,166
<font size="20">Intxaurrak nabarmentzen dituelako.</font>

887
00:50:26,958 --> 00:50:28,666
<font size="20">- Eskerrik asko.
- Ikusi arte.</font>

888
00:50:34,375 --> 00:50:35,208
<font size="20">Maud.</font>

889
00:50:35,958 --> 00:50:37,708
<font size="20">Zer zabiltza, Elizabeth?</font>

890
00:50:38,291 --> 00:50:41,333
<font size="20">Nire dolumin bizienak
adierazi nahi nizkizun.</font>

891
00:50:41,916 --> 00:50:43,958
<font size="20">Tony oso tipo jatorra zen.</font>

892
00:50:45,083 --> 00:50:47,083
<font size="20">Badakizu nork hil zezakeen?</font>

893
00:50:48,416 --> 00:50:51,291
<font size="20">Asko dakit askori buruz, maitea.</font>

894
00:50:51,375 --> 00:50:55,291
<font size="20">Baina ez dut partekatuko.
Eta ez poliziengandik gertu.</font>

895
00:50:55,791 --> 00:50:58,583
<font size="20">Bai, zerri hutsak dira.</font>

896
00:50:58,666 --> 00:51:01,208
<font size="20">- Beti bezala, ezta?
- Bai.</font>

897
00:51:02,791 --> 00:51:04,958
<font size="20">A ze lore politak.</font>

898
00:51:06,125 --> 00:51:09,166
<font size="20">Bai, Tony maite zuen
aspaldiko lagun baten partez.</font>

899
00:51:09,666 --> 00:51:11,833
<font size="20">Batzuek oraindik hezibide ona dute.</font>

900
00:51:17,500 --> 00:51:21,875
<font size="20">NIRE DOLUMIN BIZIENAK.
MAITASUN HANDIZ, B.T.</font>

901
00:51:24,833 --> 00:51:29,000
<font size="20">Jason, ondo zaude, seme?
Uste nuen trago bat hartzera zentozela.</font>

902
00:51:29,083 --> 00:51:32,208
<font size="20">- Joan behar dut. Ustekabe bat.
- Heldu berria zara.</font>

903
00:51:32,291 --> 00:51:34,791
<font size="20">- Ba joan behar dut.
- Zer gertatzen da?</font>

904
00:51:34,875 --> 00:51:38,666
<font size="20">- Aita, utzi bakean, bale?
- E, zergatik zaude horren haserre?</font>

905
00:51:38,750 --> 00:51:42,958
<font size="20">Begira, badakit lotsatzen zaituela
telebistan ibiltzearenak,</font>

906
00:51:43,041 --> 00:51:45,416
<font size="20">baina ez duzu horren argi utzi behar.</font>

907
00:51:45,958 --> 00:51:47,916
<font size="20">Ez nago lotsatuta, Jason.</font>

908
00:51:48,000 --> 00:51:51,791
<font size="20">Ez dizut gezurra esango.
Askoz hobeto ezagutzen dut boxeoa.</font>

909
00:51:51,875 --> 00:51:56,041
<font size="20">- Ene bada, egundokoa izan zinatekeen.
- Ezin duzu saihestu.</font>

910
00:51:56,125 --> 00:51:58,291
<font size="20">- Zer?
- Joan behar dut.</font>

911
00:51:59,125 --> 00:52:00,666
<font size="20">- Kontuz ibili.
- Berehala.</font>

912
00:52:00,750 --> 00:52:02,375
<font size="20">Bale. Kontuz motorrarekin.</font>

913
00:52:10,458 --> 00:52:11,791
<font size="20">Jasonek gezurra esan dizu.</font>

914
00:52:12,750 --> 00:52:13,625
<font size="20">E?</font>

915
00:52:13,708 --> 00:52:15,833
<font size="20">Tony Curranen fitxategian dago.</font>

916
00:52:15,916 --> 00:52:19,041
<font size="20">Berarentzat eta Ian Venthamentzat
egiten zuen lan</font>

917
00:52:19,125 --> 00:52:21,166
<font size="20">telebistan hasi aurretik.</font>

918
00:52:21,250 --> 00:52:23,333
<font size="20">- Eta are gehiago.
- Zer?</font>

919
00:52:24,375 --> 00:52:27,541
<font size="20">Jason argazkian agertzen den
hirugarren gizona da.</font>

920
00:52:28,083 --> 00:52:31,166
<font size="20">Ispiluko besoa. Tatuaje bera da.
Zure mugikorra?</font>

921
00:52:31,250 --> 00:52:32,791
<font size="20">Hemen.</font>

922
00:52:33,958 --> 00:52:35,166
<font size="20">Erakuts iezadazu.</font>

923
00:52:36,916 --> 00:52:37,750
<font size="20">Begira.</font>

924
00:52:42,958 --> 00:52:45,833
<font size="20">- Jason oso presaka omen zebilen.
- Bai, egia da.</font>

925
00:52:46,416 --> 00:52:49,375
<font size="20">Bera eta Ian Ventham
zelatatu beharko genituzke.</font>

926
00:52:50,250 --> 00:52:52,458
<font size="20">Ez dugu inor desagertzea nahi.</font>

927
00:53:07,250 --> 00:53:09,250
<font size="20">Autoeskolako batek aurreratu zaitu.</font>

928
00:53:09,333 --> 00:53:11,875
<font size="20">Jainkoarren, jakin nahi dugu zein bizkor</font>

929
00:53:11,958 --> 00:53:15,416
<font size="20">gidatu zezakeen Ian Venthamek
Tony Curranen etxeraino.</font>

930
00:53:15,500 --> 00:53:16,875
<font size="20">Gakoa da "bizkor".</font>

931
00:53:17,458 --> 00:53:19,000
<font size="20">Gominolarik nahi inork?</font>

932
00:53:19,500 --> 00:53:21,791
<font size="20">Kalkulua ez da abiaduran oinarritzen.</font>

933
00:53:21,875 --> 00:53:25,000
<font size="20">Algoritmo samar zail bati esker,
zehaztuko dut</font>

934
00:53:25,083 --> 00:53:28,083
<font size="20">garaiz heldu ote zatekeen
Tony Curran hiltzeko.</font>

935
00:53:28,166 --> 00:53:30,041
<font size="20">Zuek izan pazientzia.</font>

936
00:53:39,833 --> 00:53:42,500
<font size="20">Entzun, izugarri lanpetuta nago, ulertzen?</font>

937
00:53:42,583 --> 00:53:45,125
<font size="20">Nire negoziokidea hiltzeak lan asko dakar.</font>

938
00:53:45,208 --> 00:53:48,916
<font size="20">Jakina. E, esan diezadakezu
nor den Tonyrekin agertzen dena?</font>

939
00:53:51,083 --> 00:53:53,791
<font size="20">- Ba, Bobby Tanner.
- Hain zuzen, Bobby Tanner.</font>

940
00:53:53,875 --> 00:53:55,791
<font size="20">Urteak daramatzagu atzetik.</font>

941
00:53:55,875 --> 00:53:57,791
<font size="20">Akusazio-zerrenda luze-luzea du.</font>

942
00:53:57,875 --> 00:54:00,416
<font size="20">Bere izena nonahi agertu da, diotenez.</font>

943
00:54:00,500 --> 00:54:03,041
<font size="20">Hiltzat jotzen nuen. Nondik atera duzue?</font>

944
00:54:03,125 --> 00:54:04,416
<font size="20">Krimenaren lekutik.</font>

945
00:54:05,583 --> 00:54:06,416
<font size="20">Benetan?</font>

946
00:54:07,291 --> 00:54:08,583
<font size="20">Bale, bale.</font>

947
00:54:08,666 --> 00:54:11,750
<font size="20">Zergatik nahasi nahiko zenuke
Bobby Tannerrekin, Ian?</font>

948
00:54:12,291 --> 00:54:14,041
<font size="20">Pertsona nazkagarria da.</font>

949
00:54:14,541 --> 00:54:17,208
<font size="20">Etsaiei atzamarrak moztu
eta bidaltzen dizkie.</font>

950
00:54:17,291 --> 00:54:19,958
<font size="20">Izozkailu betea genuen Scotland Yarden.</font>

951
00:54:21,291 --> 00:54:24,666
<font size="20">Esaiguzu orain
edo beste modu batean jakingo dugu.</font>

952
00:54:27,625 --> 00:54:28,958
<font size="20">Hirugarren jabea da.</font>

953
00:54:30,458 --> 00:54:34,166
<font size="20">- Zeren hirugarren jabea?
- Coopers Chase. Makalak zarete, gero.</font>

954
00:54:36,375 --> 00:54:39,833
<font size="20">Tony Curranek ekarri zuen
dirua behar izan zuenean.</font>

955
00:54:40,333 --> 00:54:43,750
<font size="20">- Ez zen nire ideia izan.
- Badakizu non egon litekeen?</font>

956
00:54:43,833 --> 00:54:45,833
<font size="20">Esan dizuet hiltzat jotzen nuela.</font>

957
00:54:45,916 --> 00:54:49,583
<font size="20">Desagertu zen orain dela pila bat urte.</font>

958
00:54:49,666 --> 00:54:51,875
<font size="20">Bizirik badago, hasi bilatzen.</font>

959
00:54:51,958 --> 00:54:53,291
<font size="20">Arriskutsua da.</font>

960
00:54:53,375 --> 00:54:55,416
<font size="20">Bobby Tannerrek Tony Curran hil zuen?</font>

961
00:54:55,500 --> 00:54:59,041
<font size="20">Ez dakit. Hori zuen lana da.
Entzun, lan pila bat daukat.</font>

962
00:54:59,125 --> 00:55:02,083
<font size="20">Zergatik liskartu zinen
Tony Curranekin hil aurretik?</font>

963
00:55:03,333 --> 00:55:05,916
<font size="20">Negozioengatik. Azaltzen zaila da.</font>

964
00:55:06,500 --> 00:55:08,125
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie ere agertzen da.</font>

965
00:55:09,333 --> 00:55:10,875
<font size="20">Tatuajeak salatzen du.</font>

966
00:55:11,375 --> 00:55:13,416
<font size="20">Eskatu zenion Curran hiltzeko?</font>

967
00:55:13,916 --> 00:55:16,708
<font size="20">Ez nioke pixa egingo sutan balego.</font>

968
00:55:17,541 --> 00:55:19,958
<font size="20">Ederra litzateke
negoziokideak hilda egotea.</font>

969
00:55:20,458 --> 00:55:23,708
<font size="20">Hamabi milioi libra irabazi dituzu
Tony hil eta gero.</font>

970
00:55:24,208 --> 00:55:25,916
<font size="20">Nola ostia dakizue hori?</font>

971
00:55:28,291 --> 00:55:30,750
<font size="20">Aizue, nik ez dut Tony Curran hil.</font>

972
00:55:30,833 --> 00:55:33,583
<font size="20">Inbertsoreekin eman nuen goiz osoa.</font>

973
00:55:33,666 --> 00:55:36,208
<font size="20">Hobe duzue Bobby Tanner
aurkitu eta espetxeratu.</font>

974
00:55:36,291 --> 00:55:40,541
<font size="20">- Leku seguruena da guztiontzat.
- Larri ikusten zaitut, Ventham jauna.</font>

975
00:55:40,625 --> 00:55:42,750
<font size="20">Bai, izerditan zaude.</font>

976
00:55:44,125 --> 00:55:47,083
<font size="20">Nahi duzuen moduan.
Premiazko zita bat daukat.</font>

977
00:55:47,166 --> 00:55:49,666
<font size="20">Zuek egin zuen lana
eta utzi niri nirea egiten.</font>

978
00:55:51,500 --> 00:55:52,416
<font size="20">Joan behar dut.</font>

979
00:55:54,041 --> 00:55:56,125
<font size="20">- Laster hitz egingo dugu.
- Bai.</font>

980
00:55:56,750 --> 00:55:58,166
<font size="20">Non dago Ventham andrea?</font>

981
00:55:59,041 --> 00:56:00,750
<font size="20">Galdetu bere abokatuari.</font>

982
00:56:03,750 --> 00:56:06,166
<font size="20">Dibortzioak oso garestiak dira, ezta?</font>

983
00:56:18,708 --> 00:56:21,250
<font size="20">Bai, nire algoritmoak
bete-betean asmatu du.</font>

984
00:56:21,333 --> 00:56:23,250
<font size="20">Trafikoa eta abiadura kontuan…</font>

985
00:56:23,333 --> 00:56:24,416
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

986
00:56:24,500 --> 00:56:29,250
<font size="20">Ian Venthamek denbora izan zuen
hona etorri eta Tony Curran hiltzeko?</font>

987
00:56:29,333 --> 00:56:30,250
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

988
00:56:30,333 --> 00:56:31,666
<font size="20">A. Kaka.</font>

989
00:56:32,750 --> 00:56:33,791
<font size="20">- Kaka.
- Kaka.</font>

990
00:56:33,875 --> 00:56:34,708
<font size="20">Kaka.</font>

991
00:56:37,583 --> 00:56:38,416
<font size="20">Jauna?</font>

992
00:56:39,583 --> 00:56:41,708
<font size="20">Ian Venthamek ez zuen Tony Curran hil.</font>

993
00:56:42,791 --> 00:56:43,625
<font size="20">Zer?</font>

994
00:56:44,708 --> 00:56:45,625
<font size="20">Zergatik ez?</font>

995
00:56:45,708 --> 00:56:47,791
<font size="20">Ezin izango zuen garaiz heldu.</font>

996
00:56:47,875 --> 00:56:50,708
<font size="20">Hil eta zazpi minutura helduko zen.</font>

997
00:56:50,791 --> 00:56:53,750
<font size="20">- Hau esan dizu…
- Ostegunetako Hilketen Klubak.</font>

998
00:56:54,875 --> 00:56:56,625
<font size="20">Barka, zeren klubak?</font>

999
00:56:57,625 --> 00:57:00,291
<font size="20">Tira, horrela deitzen diote bere buruari.</font>

1000
00:57:01,500 --> 00:57:02,916
<font size="20">Elizabethek eta besteek.</font>

1001
00:57:03,000 --> 00:57:06,125
<font size="20">Curranen etxera gidatu eta kalkulatu dute.</font>

1002
00:57:06,625 --> 00:57:10,166
<font size="20">Griffiths dabil zeregin gauza bera egiten.</font>

1003
00:57:10,250 --> 00:57:11,875
<font size="20">Arraiopola.</font>

1004
00:57:12,541 --> 00:57:14,916
<font size="20">Hogeita hamar urte daramatzat honetan.</font>

1005
00:57:15,000 --> 00:57:17,708
<font size="20">Ez diet lau jubilaturi
sudurra sartzen utziko.</font>

1006
00:57:17,791 --> 00:57:20,875
<font size="20">- Griffiths, zer daukazu?
- Datuetan oinarrituta…</font>

1007
00:57:20,958 --> 00:57:22,833
<font size="20">Esadazu zuzenean.</font>

1008
00:57:23,541 --> 00:57:27,416
<font size="20">Denbora izan zuen
Venthamek Curran hiltzeko?</font>

1009
00:57:28,458 --> 00:57:30,375
<font size="20">- Ez.
- Ba ospa, Griffiths.</font>

1010
00:57:47,208 --> 00:57:49,250
<font size="20">- Kaixo, Donna.
- Kaixo, Elizabeth.</font>

1011
00:57:49,958 --> 00:57:51,750
<font size="20">- Zure laguntza behar dut.
- Esan.</font>

1012
00:57:51,833 --> 00:57:56,208
<font size="20">Hilketaren lekuan, bere argazki bat
topatu genuen Bobby Tannerrekin.</font>

1013
00:57:57,708 --> 00:57:58,583
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner?</font>

1014
00:57:59,208 --> 00:58:01,833
<font size="20">Bere entzuera badut. Nazkagarria da.</font>

1015
00:58:01,916 --> 00:58:03,708
<font size="20">Drogetan eta hilketetan sartuta dago.</font>

1016
00:58:04,375 --> 00:58:05,208
<font size="20">Horixe bera.</font>

1017
00:58:05,875 --> 00:58:09,833
<font size="20">Eta berarekin hitz egin behar dugu,
baina aspaldi desagertu zen.</font>

1018
00:58:09,916 --> 00:58:11,916
<font size="20">Aurkitzen laguntzerik baduzu?</font>

1019
00:58:12,500 --> 00:58:13,458
<font size="20">Bai, jakina.</font>

1020
00:58:14,166 --> 00:58:17,208
<font size="20">Izan dezakezun
edozein informazio berriren truke.</font>

1021
00:58:17,750 --> 00:58:18,875
<font size="20">Elizabeth.</font>

1022
00:58:18,958 --> 00:58:22,375
<font size="20">Tira, Donna.
Badakizu nola funtzionatzen duen honek.</font>

1023
00:58:25,333 --> 00:58:29,125
<font size="20">Gogoan duzu aipatu nizun argazkia?
Beste gizon bat agertzen da.</font>

1024
00:58:29,208 --> 00:58:30,791
<font size="20">Nor?</font>

1025
00:58:31,416 --> 00:58:32,458
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie.</font>

1026
00:58:34,625 --> 00:58:35,458
<font size="20">Nola?</font>

1027
00:58:36,458 --> 00:58:37,541
<font size="20">Eta are gehiago.</font>

1028
00:58:40,708 --> 00:58:42,250
<font size="20">Deitu minutu batzuetan.</font>

1029
00:59:04,916 --> 00:59:06,833
<font size="20">Ez hildakoak esnatu.</font>

1030
00:59:12,041 --> 00:59:13,250
<font size="20">Jainko maitea.</font>

1031
00:59:13,333 --> 00:59:15,541
<font size="20">- Aurpegia ikusi diozu?
- Ilun zegoen.</font>

1032
00:59:16,416 --> 00:59:20,041
<font size="20">Beraz, Ian Ventham
susmagarri nagusia ez bada ere,</font>

1033
00:59:20,125 --> 00:59:22,958
<font size="20">ez du esan nahi hilarazi ez zuenik.</font>

1034
00:59:23,041 --> 00:59:25,833
<font size="20">Hain zuzen. Eta hori da kontu bitxiena.</font>

1035
00:59:25,916 --> 00:59:28,583
<font size="20">Poliziak Jasonekin hitz egin nahi du.</font>

1036
00:59:29,250 --> 00:59:32,416
<font size="20">Diotenez, lantxoak egiten zituen</font>

1037
00:59:32,500 --> 00:59:36,333
<font size="20">Ventham eta Tony Curranentzat
liskarti bat behar zutenean.</font>

1038
00:59:36,416 --> 00:59:39,375
<font size="20">- Nola liskarti?
- Horixe da zehaztu behar duguna.</font>

1039
00:59:39,458 --> 00:59:40,833
<font size="20">Ez diot Roni kontatu.</font>

1040
00:59:40,916 --> 00:59:44,458
<font size="20">Zorionez, lanpetuta dabil
protesta antolatzen.</font>

1041
00:59:44,541 --> 00:59:47,291
<font size="20">Eta, bide batez, joan beharko nuke.</font>

1042
00:59:48,125 --> 00:59:51,791
<font size="20">Astelehenean jasoko zaitut?
Elkarrekin joan gaitezke.</font>

1043
00:59:51,875 --> 00:59:53,083
<font size="20">Bai horixe.</font>

1044
00:59:53,583 --> 00:59:55,916
<font size="20">Ezin dugu onartu hilerria zulatu</font>

1045
00:59:56,000 --> 00:59:59,333
<font size="20">eta Penny kalean utz dezaten.
Ez da gertatuko, inola ere.</font>

1046
00:59:59,416 --> 01:00:00,458
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

1047
01:00:00,541 --> 01:00:02,333
<font size="20">Astelehenean borrokatuko gara.</font>

1048
01:00:05,416 --> 01:00:09,333
<font size="20">Entzun guztiok!
Bildu zaitezte guztiak oraintxe!</font>

1049
01:00:09,416 --> 01:00:10,500
<font size="20">IAN VENTHAM KANPORA</font>

1050
01:00:10,583 --> 01:00:14,291
<font size="20">Giza-barrikada osatuko dugu
hilerri aurrean</font>

1051
01:00:14,375 --> 01:00:18,541
<font size="20">eta elkartasuna
erakutsiko diogu elkarri. Ulertuta?</font>

1052
01:00:19,250 --> 01:00:20,166
<font size="20">Bai!</font>

1053
01:00:20,250 --> 01:00:22,750
<font size="20">Goazen, ba. Hori da.</font>

1054
01:00:23,500 --> 01:00:24,416
<font size="20">Eutsi gogor.</font>

1055
01:00:24,500 --> 01:00:26,250
<font size="20">EZ IANI
EZ LURRA HONDEATU</font>

1056
01:00:26,333 --> 01:00:28,083
<font size="20">Ez gaitezen belauniko bizi.</font>

1057
01:00:28,166 --> 01:00:30,541
<font size="20">- Hori da.
- Ez dugu inoiz amore emango.</font>

1058
01:00:30,625 --> 01:00:33,791
<font size="20">- Eskerrik asko bioi etortzeagatik.
- Gelditu dezagun.</font>

1059
01:00:33,875 --> 01:00:35,750
<font size="20">Hara, primeran, lagunok.</font>

1060
01:00:35,833 --> 01:00:38,541
<font size="20">Bernardek lelo zaharra birziklatu du.
Nirea berria da.</font>

1061
01:00:38,625 --> 01:00:41,458
<font size="20">Entzun, gaur ez dut
ika-mikarik nahi, bale?</font>

1062
01:00:41,541 --> 01:00:43,750
<font size="20">- Gaur elkartasuna nagusi da.
- Noski.</font>

1063
01:00:44,333 --> 01:00:45,833
<font size="20">Aparta zara, Ibra.</font>

1064
01:00:46,333 --> 01:00:49,000
<font size="20">Joyce, zergatik ekarri duzu kafe-makina?</font>

1065
01:00:49,083 --> 01:00:51,583
<font size="20">Ez da erromeria, protesta serioa baizik.</font>

1066
01:00:51,666 --> 01:00:55,208
<font size="20">Badakit, baina kafe onarekin
luzeago protestatu dezakegu.</font>

1067
01:00:56,083 --> 01:00:57,791
<font size="20">A ze burutsua den, bai.</font>

1068
01:01:02,458 --> 01:01:04,958
<font size="20">Hemen da etsaia!</font>

1069
01:01:06,083 --> 01:01:09,375
<font size="20">Ez da izango! Ezin dute hori egin!</font>

1070
01:01:11,458 --> 01:01:13,791
<font size="20">Hartu pala,
sartu atzetik eta hasi zulatzen.</font>

1071
01:01:13,875 --> 01:01:16,250
<font size="20">Ezin dut asko aurreratu pala batekin.</font>

1072
01:01:16,333 --> 01:01:18,583
<font size="20">Legez, gaur hasi behar dugu, ulertzen?</font>

1073
01:01:18,666 --> 01:01:21,125
<font size="20">Zulatzen hasi eta kito. Ospa.</font>

1074
01:01:21,208 --> 01:01:22,208
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1075
01:01:30,000 --> 01:01:31,333
<font size="20">Egin alde batera!</font>

1076
01:01:34,000 --> 01:01:36,958
<font size="20">Kendu bidetik. Banoa.</font>

1077
01:01:37,041 --> 01:01:39,125
<font size="20">Arraioa, The Walking Dead dirudi.</font>

1078
01:01:40,291 --> 01:01:41,291
<font size="20">Aurrera.</font>

1079
01:01:41,375 --> 01:01:45,125
<font size="20">Badator. Ez zaitezte mugitu.
Eutsi hor. Horrela.</font>

1080
01:01:45,625 --> 01:01:46,458
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1081
01:01:46,541 --> 01:01:49,750
<font size="20">Ze ostia da hau?</font>

1082
01:01:49,833 --> 01:01:54,041
<font size="20">80ko hamarkada berpizten?
Azkenekoz zutitu zitzaizuna gogoratzen?</font>

1083
01:01:54,125 --> 01:01:56,791
<font size="20">Zer uste duzu dela? Protesta!</font>

1084
01:01:57,416 --> 01:02:00,958
<font size="20">Zu baino gizon hobeak agurtu dituzten
pertsonak daude hemen.</font>

1085
01:02:01,041 --> 01:02:05,375
<font size="20">Irakasleak eta soldaduak dauzkagu,
medikuak eta bankariak.</font>

1086
01:02:06,250 --> 01:02:07,791
<font size="20">Eta zer nahi dugu?</font>

1087
01:02:07,875 --> 01:02:11,500
<font size="20">- Ez zulatzea!
- Letra handiagoa menuan.</font>

1088
01:02:12,416 --> 01:02:15,000
<font size="20">Modelo guztiz biluziak marrazketa-klasean.</font>

1089
01:02:15,083 --> 01:02:18,750
<font size="20">Itxaron, ezin ditugu oihukatu
nahi ditugun gauza guztiak.</font>

1090
01:02:18,833 --> 01:02:20,666
<font size="20">Ez! Elkartasuna!</font>

1091
01:02:20,750 --> 01:02:24,083
<font size="20">Bale, kendu guztiak bidetik.
Utzi zulatzen hasten.</font>

1092
01:02:24,166 --> 01:02:28,041
<font size="20">- Ez zara hilerrian sartuko.
- E, kendu eskuak gainetik, Ventham.</font>

1093
01:02:28,125 --> 01:02:30,708
<font size="20">Zoaz pikutara, Jason, zerri saltzailea.</font>

1094
01:02:30,791 --> 01:02:34,333
<font size="20">Nire eta jendetza honen gainetik
pasatu beharko duzu.</font>

1095
01:02:34,416 --> 01:02:37,166
<font size="20">Beraz, Ian Ventham, ospa.</font>

1096
01:02:37,791 --> 01:02:41,208
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, ospa!</font>

1097
01:02:41,291 --> 01:02:42,125
<font size="20">Hori da!</font>

1098
01:02:43,000 --> 01:02:46,541
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, ospa!</font>

1099
01:02:46,625 --> 01:02:47,625
<font size="20">Elkartasuna!</font>

1100
01:02:48,750 --> 01:02:51,875
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, ospa!</font>

1101
01:02:52,916 --> 01:02:57,083
<font size="20">Eutsi, anai-arrebok.
Zuen burua entzunarazi!</font>

1102
01:02:57,875 --> 01:03:00,000
<font size="20">Poliziari deituko diot.</font>

1103
01:03:00,083 --> 01:03:02,375
<font size="20">Noski. Esan apaiz bati eraso diozula!</font>

1104
01:03:03,250 --> 01:03:04,541
<font size="20">Ian Ventham, ospa!</font>

1105
01:03:05,833 --> 01:03:07,875
<font size="20">Kaixo, barka,</font>

1106
01:03:08,875 --> 01:03:10,958
<font size="20">okil bat ikusi al duzu?</font>

1107
01:03:11,041 --> 01:03:13,166
<font size="20">Uste dut okil bat ikusi dudala.</font>

1108
01:03:14,416 --> 01:03:15,250
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

1109
01:03:17,166 --> 01:03:20,375
<font size="20">A, inguruan ikusi zaitut
gauzak konpontzen, ezta?</font>

1110
01:03:20,458 --> 01:03:22,250
<font size="20">Bogdan duzu izena?</font>

1111
01:03:23,541 --> 01:03:24,375
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

1112
01:03:29,833 --> 01:03:30,666
<font size="20">Ni Marina.</font>

1113
01:03:34,875 --> 01:03:37,125
<font size="20">- Nire ama horrela deitzen da.
- Ez!</font>

1114
01:03:37,666 --> 01:03:40,458
<font size="20">Benetan? Hori kointzidentzia, ezta?</font>

1115
01:03:40,541 --> 01:03:44,000
<font size="20">Tira, izen polita da.
Normala da iritzi hori izatea.</font>

1116
01:03:44,958 --> 01:03:48,791
<font size="20">- Zurekin dago?
- Ez, Polonian dago.</font>

1117
01:03:51,208 --> 01:03:54,125
<font size="20">Bere falta sentituko duzu, ezta?</font>

1118
01:03:55,500 --> 01:03:57,083
<font size="20">Eta berak zurea.</font>

1119
01:03:59,791 --> 01:04:02,791
<font size="20">Bere falta sentitzen dut egunero.</font>

1120
01:04:05,291 --> 01:04:07,875
<font size="20">- Polonieraz dakizu?
- Bai, pixka bat.</font>

1121
01:04:09,791 --> 01:04:11,750
<font size="20">Beragatik etorri nintzen Ingalaterrara.</font>

1122
01:04:11,833 --> 01:04:15,541
<font size="20">Bada, lan hobea, soldata hobea</font>

1123
01:04:16,208 --> 01:04:18,208
<font size="20">ahal dudan diru guztia bidaltzeko.</font>

1124
01:04:18,833 --> 01:04:20,625
<font size="20">Poloniako ze aldekoa zara?</font>

1125
01:04:20,708 --> 01:04:21,583
<font size="20">Krakovia.</font>

1126
01:04:21,666 --> 01:04:26,625
<font size="20">A, egundoko zopa hartu nuen
Krakovian. E, krupnik.</font>

1127
01:04:26,708 --> 01:04:28,958
<font size="20">- A, bai, garagar-zopa.
- Horixe.</font>

1128
01:04:29,666 --> 01:04:31,500
<font size="20">Zer zenbiltzan Polonian?</font>

1129
01:04:32,375 --> 01:04:33,500
<font size="20">Zirku ibiltarian.</font>

1130
01:04:34,375 --> 01:04:35,875
<font size="20">Garai aparta izan zen.</font>

1131
01:04:36,625 --> 01:04:37,458
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1132
01:04:38,708 --> 01:04:39,916
<font size="20">Barregarria, ezta?</font>

1133
01:04:40,000 --> 01:04:43,333
<font size="20">Hau pala batekin egitea,
baina orain nire ardura da.</font>

1134
01:04:43,416 --> 01:04:45,833
<font size="20">A, Tony ordezkatu duzu nagusi gisa?</font>

1135
01:04:45,916 --> 01:04:49,208
<font size="20">Bai, orain ni naiz
hemengo kontratista nagusia.</font>

1136
01:04:51,958 --> 01:04:54,916
<font size="20">Ianek lana eman zizun Tony hil aurretik?</font>

1137
01:04:56,333 --> 01:05:01,000
<font size="20">Bai, Marina, nire lana zen
Tony hil aurretik. Zergatik?</font>

1138
01:05:01,916 --> 01:05:04,500
<font size="20">Zerbait galdetu nahi didazu?</font>

1139
01:05:06,541 --> 01:05:09,750
<font size="20">Kontua da Ianek dirutza
irabazi zuela Tony hildakoan,</font>

1140
01:05:09,833 --> 01:05:13,333
<font size="20">beraz, jakin nahiko nuke</font>

1141
01:05:14,208 --> 01:05:16,916
<font size="20">norbaiti eskatu ote zion Tony hiltzeko.</font>

1142
01:05:19,458 --> 01:05:20,333
<font size="20">Ez dakit.</font>

1143
01:05:21,916 --> 01:05:22,833
<font size="20">Beharbada.</font>

1144
01:05:25,250 --> 01:05:27,333
<font size="20">Orduan zehatzagoa izango naiz.</font>

1145
01:05:28,541 --> 01:05:31,458
<font size="20">Ianek Tony hiltzeko eskatu zizun?</font>

1146
01:05:33,583 --> 01:05:34,416
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

1147
01:05:35,666 --> 01:05:38,791
<font size="20">Eta eskatu balit ere,
ezetz esango niokeen.</font>

1148
01:05:39,708 --> 01:05:43,583
<font size="20">Gauza asko egingo nituzke
Ian Venthamengatik. Hezurrak zulatu,</font>

1149
01:05:44,166 --> 01:05:46,291
<font size="20">baina ez nuke gizon bat hilko.</font>

1150
01:05:51,708 --> 01:05:54,250
<font size="20">Inork ez zaitu hemen nahi. Zoaz etxera!</font>

1151
01:05:54,333 --> 01:05:56,916
<font size="20">Irakurri seinaleak eta ospa hemendik.</font>

1152
01:05:59,083 --> 01:06:00,666
<font size="20">Aska nazazue! Geldi!</font>

1153
01:06:02,250 --> 01:06:03,375
<font size="20">Askatzeko!</font>

1154
01:06:05,625 --> 01:06:07,750
<font size="20">Ez nazazue ukitu! Uzteko!</font>

1155
01:06:08,833 --> 01:06:09,916
<font size="20">Ez ukitu!</font>

1156
01:06:11,291 --> 01:06:13,250
<font size="20">- E!
- Inork ez zaitu nahi!</font>

1157
01:06:13,333 --> 01:06:15,875
<font size="20">Zergatik ez diguzu entzuten?</font>

1158
01:06:16,375 --> 01:06:17,791
<font size="20">- E!
- Zergatik?</font>

1159
01:06:19,416 --> 01:06:20,416
<font size="20">Ez! Hau…</font>

1160
01:06:23,791 --> 01:06:24,625
<font size="20">Hau…</font>

1161
01:06:26,375 --> 01:06:28,333
<font size="20">Utzi pasatzen.</font>

1162
01:06:47,416 --> 01:06:48,583
<font size="20">Hilda dago.</font>

1163
01:06:54,250 --> 01:06:55,083
<font size="20">Arraiopola.</font>

1164
01:07:14,208 --> 01:07:15,041
<font size="20">Ba…</font>

1165
01:07:15,875 --> 01:07:17,875
<font size="20">guztiok gara hilketa baten lekuko.</font>

1166
01:07:20,541 --> 01:07:21,958
<font size="20">Lehen galdera, beraz.</font>

1167
01:07:22,041 --> 01:07:24,666
<font size="20">Nola dakizu hilketa izan zela
eta ez bihotzekoa?</font>

1168
01:07:24,750 --> 01:07:26,250
<font size="20">- Larri zebilen.
- Bai.</font>

1169
01:07:26,333 --> 01:07:29,166
<font size="20">Litekeena da
fentanilo-gaindosiaz hil izana,</font>

1170
01:07:29,250 --> 01:07:31,500
<font size="20">hil aurretik emanda.</font>

1171
01:07:31,583 --> 01:07:33,666
<font size="20">Laborategi-txostenaren zain daude.</font>

1172
01:07:33,750 --> 01:07:37,166
<font size="20">- Nondik atera duzu informazio hori?
- Donnak idatzi dit.</font>

1173
01:07:37,666 --> 01:07:41,250
<font size="20">- Oso lagungarria da.
- Nondik atera zen fentaniloa?</font>

1174
01:07:41,333 --> 01:07:44,750
<font size="20">Medikuntzan baliatzen da
anestesiarako eta analgesiko gisa.</font>

1175
01:07:44,833 --> 01:07:46,916
<font size="20">Oso eraginkorra da.</font>

1176
01:07:47,416 --> 01:07:51,041
<font size="20">Baina dosi handiegia
hilgarria izan liteke.</font>

1177
01:07:51,125 --> 01:07:55,625
<font size="20">Beraz, orratzak eta medikamentuak
eskuratu ditzakeen norbait izango zen.</font>

1178
01:07:55,708 --> 01:07:59,125
<font size="20">Bai, Coopers Chaseko
ia edonor izan liteke, Ron.</font>

1179
01:07:59,208 --> 01:08:02,166
<font size="20">Lekuan zeuden
guztien argazkiak bildu ditut.</font>

1180
01:08:02,250 --> 01:08:04,750
<font size="20">Nire ustez, pilaketan izan zen.</font>

1181
01:08:04,833 --> 01:08:10,083
<font size="20">Dosi hilgarria eman zioten
guztiak liskartzen ziren bitartean.</font>

1182
01:08:10,166 --> 01:08:13,083
<font size="20">- Beraz, hiltzailea argazkietan dago?
- Bai.</font>

1183
01:08:13,666 --> 01:08:16,750
<font size="20">- Denok gaude argazkiotan.
- Denok gara susmagarriak.</font>

1184
01:08:28,750 --> 01:08:32,208
<font size="20">Bide batez, oraindik ez dugu argitu
Bobby Tannerren buruhaustea.</font>

1185
01:08:32,291 --> 01:08:33,125
<font size="20">Ze buruhauste?</font>

1186
01:08:33,708 --> 01:08:34,625
<font size="20">- Nor?
- Zer?</font>

1187
01:08:35,458 --> 01:08:39,625
<font size="20">- A, barka, barka, ez dizuet aipatu?
- Ez, ez duzu egin.</font>

1188
01:08:39,708 --> 01:08:44,541
<font size="20">Donnak kontatu dit Tony Curranen
hilketaren lekuan argazki bat zegoela,</font>

1189
01:08:44,625 --> 01:08:49,083
<font size="20">non agertzen diren Tony Curran,
gaizkile famatu bat, Bobby Tanner, eta…</font>

1190
01:08:52,791 --> 01:08:53,666
<font size="20">Eta nor?</font>

1191
01:08:54,666 --> 01:08:57,708
<font size="20">- Ez dio axola, ez du garrantzirik.
- Ez.</font>

1192
01:08:57,791 --> 01:09:01,625
<font size="20">Ez, zera, ez zenizkiguke
gauzak ezkutatu behar, taldea gara.</font>

1193
01:09:01,708 --> 01:09:03,666
<font size="20">Ez ba. Bada…</font>

1194
01:09:04,208 --> 01:09:06,458
<font size="20">Donnak batzuetan gauez idazten dit</font>

1195
01:09:06,541 --> 01:09:09,000
<font size="20">eta une egokiaren zain nengoen,
besterik ez.</font>

1196
01:09:09,083 --> 01:09:13,708
<font size="20">Ba une bikaina dela esango nuke.
Kontatuko diguzu?</font>

1197
01:09:15,125 --> 01:09:16,250
<font size="20">Oraingoz,</font>

1198
01:09:16,333 --> 01:09:19,541
<font size="20">polizia Bobby Tannerren bila dabil,
baita gu ere.</font>

1199
01:09:19,625 --> 01:09:23,041
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner Coopers Chaseko
hirugarren jabea da, Ian Ventham</font>

1200
01:09:23,125 --> 01:09:24,125
<font size="20">eta Tony Curranekin.</font>

1201
01:09:24,208 --> 01:09:27,333
<font size="20">Eta argi geratzen da
Ian Venthamen azken-nahian</font>

1202
01:09:27,416 --> 01:09:31,708
<font size="20">Coopers Chaseko proiektuak
jarraituko duela Ian hil eta gero.</font>

1203
01:09:31,791 --> 01:09:33,916
<font size="20">Bobby Tannerrek bakarrik gelditu dezake.</font>

1204
01:09:34,000 --> 01:09:35,750
<font size="20">Eta inork ez daki non dagoen.</font>

1205
01:09:35,833 --> 01:09:38,708
<font size="20">Oraindik ez da amaitu
gure etxeen aldeko borroka.</font>

1206
01:09:39,583 --> 01:09:42,916
<font size="20">Hilda zein bizirik,
Ian Venthamek izorratu gaitzake.</font>

1207
01:09:43,500 --> 01:09:47,333
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner bizirik irauten duen
Coopers Chaseko jabe bakarra da?</font>

1208
01:09:47,416 --> 01:09:49,666
<font size="20">Bai, hala dirudi.</font>

1209
01:09:49,750 --> 01:09:51,875
<font size="20">Baina hilda egon liteke, batek daki.</font>

1210
01:09:51,958 --> 01:09:54,875
<font size="20">Aurkituko bagenu,
proiektua gelditu genezake?</font>

1211
01:09:54,958 --> 01:09:57,125
<font size="20">Eta Coopers Chase salbatu.</font>

1212
01:09:57,208 --> 01:10:01,041
<font size="20">- Eta hilerria ere bai.
- Bai. Beraz, hobe dugu hasi.</font>

1213
01:10:01,125 --> 01:10:04,125
<font size="20">Bai, trikotatzea ordubete barru hasiko da.</font>

1214
01:10:04,666 --> 01:10:05,500
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1215
01:10:06,000 --> 01:10:07,416
<font size="20">Noiz hasi zinen jokatzen?</font>

1216
01:10:07,500 --> 01:10:13,500
<font size="20">Aitak irakatsi zidan hamar urte nituenean
eta ez nuen garaitu 13 izan arte.</font>

1217
01:10:15,375 --> 01:10:18,458
<font size="20">- Ez zidan irabazten uzten.
- Egundokoa.</font>

1218
01:10:18,541 --> 01:10:19,958
<font size="20">- Bai.
- Xake-mate.</font>

1219
01:10:20,041 --> 01:10:21,708
<font size="20">Ene, bada.</font>

1220
01:10:21,791 --> 01:10:23,416
<font size="20">A, Elizabeth.</font>

1221
01:10:23,500 --> 01:10:25,541
<font size="20">Jauna zu ikustera etorri da.</font>

1222
01:10:25,625 --> 01:10:27,291
<font size="20">Eta xakean ere badaki.</font>

1223
01:10:28,250 --> 01:10:30,208
<font size="20">Berealdiko jokalaria da.</font>

1224
01:10:31,125 --> 01:10:33,458
<font size="20">A, eta ikasgelako wifia konpondu dit.</font>

1225
01:10:34,458 --> 01:10:36,708
<font size="20">Bogdan, hau ustekabeko sorpresa.</font>

1226
01:10:37,708 --> 01:10:40,125
<font size="20">Barka eragozpena, Elizabeth.</font>

1227
01:10:42,666 --> 01:10:44,166
<font size="20">Ez kezkatu. Ongi etorri.</font>

1228
01:10:46,125 --> 01:10:48,125
<font size="20">Milesker partidagatik. Joan behar dut.</font>

1229
01:10:48,208 --> 01:10:50,000
<font size="20">- Plazera izan da.
- Joan behar dut.</font>

1230
01:10:50,083 --> 01:10:51,083
<font size="20">Lagunduko diot.</font>

1231
01:10:51,166 --> 01:10:53,583
<font size="20">- Elizabeth.
- Esan, zertara etorri zara?</font>

1232
01:10:53,666 --> 01:10:56,833
<font size="20">Hitz egin behar dugu.
Ez nekien beste norengana jo.</font>

1233
01:10:56,916 --> 01:11:01,083
<font size="20">Poliziak Ianen hilketaz galdetu dit
eta esan diet Marinarekin nengoela.</font>

1234
01:11:01,166 --> 01:11:04,000
<font size="20">Baina ez dute
Marinarik ezagutzen Coopers Chasen.</font>

1235
01:11:04,083 --> 01:11:08,208
<font size="20">Beraz, galdera gehiegi egiten dituen
andre menderatzailea bilatu dut.</font>

1236
01:11:08,750 --> 01:11:10,458
<font size="20">Eta denek zekiten zeu zinela.</font>

1237
01:11:10,541 --> 01:11:12,125
<font size="20">Bale. Harrapatu nauzu.</font>

1238
01:11:13,083 --> 01:11:15,625
<font size="20">Uste nuen zurekin hitz egiteko
izen horrekin</font>

1239
01:11:15,708 --> 01:11:18,125
<font size="20">zure konfiantza irabaz nezakeela.</font>

1240
01:11:18,208 --> 01:11:19,875
<font size="20">Trikimailu merkea.</font>

1241
01:11:19,958 --> 01:11:22,750
<font size="20">Bai. Ohitura izan da, sentitzen dut.</font>

1242
01:11:26,416 --> 01:11:27,916
<font size="20">Zertara etorri zara?</font>

1243
01:11:29,125 --> 01:11:31,000
<font size="20">Zerbait erakutsi behar dizut.</font>

1244
01:11:31,583 --> 01:11:33,000
<font size="20">Gaur.</font>

1245
01:11:33,083 --> 01:11:34,791
<font size="20">Ilundu eta gero.</font>

1246
01:11:35,291 --> 01:11:38,375
<font size="20">Hilerrian elkartuko gara. Zatoz bakarrik.</font>

1247
01:11:39,250 --> 01:11:40,291
<font size="20">Bakar-bakarrik.</font>

1248
01:11:40,958 --> 01:11:41,791
<font size="20">Mesedez.</font>

1249
01:11:43,500 --> 01:11:44,500
<font size="20">Bakar-bakarrik.</font>

1250
01:11:46,416 --> 01:11:47,250
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1251
01:11:51,833 --> 01:11:55,416
<font size="20">Adi. Biratu, posizioan. Atera bularra.</font>

1252
01:11:55,500 --> 01:12:00,666
<font size="20">Ezker-eskuin. Eutsi.</font>

1253
01:12:00,750 --> 01:12:04,875
<font size="20">Azken jauzia. Gora, ezkerrera. Primeran.</font>

1254
01:12:07,916 --> 01:12:08,750
<font size="20">Hor dago.</font>

1255
01:12:11,000 --> 01:12:11,875
<font size="20">Aurkeztu.</font>

1256
01:12:11,958 --> 01:12:13,541
<font size="20">- Eta aurkeztu.
- Primeran.</font>

1257
01:12:17,166 --> 01:12:19,625
<font size="20">Esango didazue zer nahi duzuen?</font>

1258
01:12:20,291 --> 01:12:22,791
<font size="20">Kontatu dizuet jada dakidana, ezer ere ez.</font>

1259
01:12:23,291 --> 01:12:26,958
<font size="20">Tony hiltzean gimnasioan nengoen
nire lagun Dan Fairhurstekin.</font>

1260
01:12:27,041 --> 01:12:30,250
<font size="20">Berarekin zeunden hil aurretik,
baina ez hil zenean.</font>

1261
01:12:30,333 --> 01:12:32,333
<font size="20">- Ikusten duzu aldea?
- Bai.</font>

1262
01:12:33,000 --> 01:12:35,458
<font size="20">Garbitzaileak aurkitu zuenez,
agian berak hil zuen.</font>

1263
01:12:36,291 --> 01:12:37,833
<font size="20">Hona nire ikuspuntua.</font>

1264
01:12:38,333 --> 01:12:41,375
<font size="20">Hiltzailea ez da
biktima hilda ikusten duen lehena,</font>

1265
01:12:41,458 --> 01:12:43,458
<font size="20">baizik eta bizirik ikusten duen azkena.</font>

1266
01:12:43,541 --> 01:12:45,333
<font size="20">- Ona.
- Columbon ikusi nuen.</font>

1267
01:12:46,083 --> 01:12:49,583
<font size="20">Eta zer nahi duzue?
Zertaz salatzen nauzue?</font>

1268
01:12:49,666 --> 01:12:54,541
<font size="20">Zergatik deitu zizun hirutan Ian Venthamek
Tony Curranekin liskartu eta gero?</font>

1269
01:12:54,625 --> 01:12:56,458
<font size="20">Mesede bat eskatzeko?</font>

1270
01:12:56,541 --> 01:12:59,750
<font size="20">Tony Curran hiltzeko eskatu zizun
bere beldur zelako?</font>

1271
01:12:59,833 --> 01:13:02,583
<font size="20">Ez, beste kontu batengatik zen.</font>

1272
01:13:02,666 --> 01:13:04,458
<font size="20">Ba nik ez dut uste, Jason.</font>

1273
01:13:05,041 --> 01:13:08,750
<font size="20">- Beste kontu batzuk zeuden.
- Dudarik gabe.</font>

1274
01:13:09,375 --> 01:13:11,916
<font size="20">Venthamek kitatu zizkizun
apustu-zorretako batzuk.</font>

1275
01:13:13,000 --> 01:13:15,458
<font size="20">Eta Venthamek ordaindu zizunez,</font>

1276
01:13:15,541 --> 01:13:18,083
<font size="20">lantxoren bat egiten zenuen beragatik.</font>

1277
01:13:18,166 --> 01:13:22,708
<font size="20">- Eskatzen zuen edozer…
- Ez, ez eskatzen zuen edozer.</font>

1278
01:13:22,791 --> 01:13:24,875
<font size="20">Zergatik deitu zizun, Jason?</font>

1279
01:13:24,958 --> 01:13:25,833
<font size="20">Ba…</font>

1280
01:13:26,750 --> 01:13:28,750
<font size="20">Kontu batengatik. Entzun…</font>

1281
01:13:29,375 --> 01:13:32,875
<font size="20">- Jarraitu behar dut.
- Bobby Tanner ezagutzen duzu?</font>

1282
01:13:33,375 --> 01:13:35,250
<font size="20">Zer? Bobby Tanner?</font>

1283
01:13:35,875 --> 01:13:37,166
<font size="20">Hilda dago, ezta?</font>

1284
01:13:39,583 --> 01:13:41,375
<font size="20">Gogoan duzu argazki hau?</font>

1285
01:13:42,791 --> 01:13:43,750
<font size="20">Ez.</font>

1286
01:13:43,833 --> 01:13:48,000
<font size="20">Ba ispilukoa zure besoa da. Ezta?</font>

1287
01:13:48,708 --> 01:13:52,250
<font size="20">Krimen antolatuan
guztiz sartuta zaude, ezta, Jason?</font>

1288
01:13:53,208 --> 01:13:56,166
<font size="20">Zer da beste exekuzio bat?</font>

1289
01:13:56,916 --> 01:13:59,541
<font size="20">Zergatik zenbiltzan
horren presaka aurrekoan?</font>

1290
01:13:59,625 --> 01:14:02,750
<font size="20">- Ihes egin nahi zenuen?
- Ez dut denborarik honetarako.</font>

1291
01:14:02,833 --> 01:14:06,833
<font size="20">Jason Ritchie, atxilotuta zaude
Tony Curran hil izanaren susmoa dela eta.</font>

1292
01:14:06,916 --> 01:14:09,083
<font size="20">Baina zer diozu? Ez duzue frogarik.</font>

1293
01:14:09,166 --> 01:14:11,416
<font size="20">Ez diguzu erantzuten.
Ez duzu zurigarririk.</font>

1294
01:14:11,500 --> 01:14:12,708
<font size="20">Modua eta zioa dituzu</font>

1295
01:14:12,791 --> 01:14:15,625
<font size="20">eta, gainera,
ihes egingo diguzun kezka daukat.</font>

1296
01:14:15,708 --> 01:14:19,291
<font size="20">Beraz, bai, atxilotu zaitzakegu.</font>

1297
01:14:19,375 --> 01:14:21,458
<font size="20">Hartu irristailuak, mesedez.</font>

1298
01:14:22,166 --> 01:14:23,583
<font size="20">Kaka.</font>

1299
01:14:26,125 --> 01:14:28,375
<font size="20">Tony Curran eta Ian Venthamen hilketa.</font>

1300
01:14:28,875 --> 01:14:30,833
<font size="20">Hiltzaile bera izango da, ziur.</font>

1301
01:14:30,916 --> 01:14:34,666
<font size="20">Bi negoziokide erail dituzte
egun gutxiko epean.</font>

1302
01:14:35,166 --> 01:14:38,458
<font size="20">Beraz,
eraikitzea gelditu nahi duen norbait.</font>

1303
01:14:38,541 --> 01:14:41,375
<font size="20">Zer deritzozu Bernardez?
Oso larrituta zegoen.</font>

1304
01:14:41,458 --> 01:14:43,458
<font size="20">Bai, jenio txarra du.</font>

1305
01:14:43,541 --> 01:14:47,458
<font size="20">Eta kimikaria da, beraz,
toxina bat eskuratzeko erraztasuna du.</font>

1306
01:14:47,541 --> 01:14:51,458
<font size="20">- Bederatzi bat ipiniko diot.
- Ez, gehiegi da. Jarri sei bat.</font>

1307
01:14:51,541 --> 01:14:55,375
<font size="20">- Bale, zazpi bat emango diot.
- Bale, ados. Eta aita Mackie?</font>

1308
01:14:55,458 --> 01:14:57,333
<font size="20">Haserretuena zen protestan.</font>

1309
01:14:58,166 --> 01:15:01,500
<font size="20">- Lehen hamarra litzateke.
- Azkenaldian oso arraro dabil.</font>

1310
01:15:01,583 --> 01:15:03,166
<font size="20">Beteko dizut?</font>

1311
01:15:03,250 --> 01:15:05,291
<font size="20">- Beteko dizut?
- Bai.</font>

1312
01:15:06,375 --> 01:15:07,791
<font size="20">Pentsatzen ibili naiz.</font>

1313
01:15:08,291 --> 01:15:09,958
<font size="20">Tony eta Ian hilda daudenez,</font>

1314
01:15:11,333 --> 01:15:13,041
<font size="20">gauzak aldatu litezke?</font>

1315
01:15:13,125 --> 01:15:15,541
<font size="20">Uste duzu kalera botako gaituztela?</font>

1316
01:15:15,625 --> 01:15:18,000
<font size="20">Coopers Chase
enpresaren egoeraren arabera.</font>

1317
01:15:18,083 --> 01:15:21,166
<font size="20">- Bobby Tanner aurkitu beharko lukete.
- Bai.</font>

1318
01:15:21,250 --> 01:15:24,208
<font size="20">- Mesedez, liburu gainean ez.
- O, barka.</font>

1319
01:15:25,250 --> 01:15:26,083
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1320
01:15:31,208 --> 01:15:32,916
<font size="20">Honen falta sentituko nuke.</font>

1321
01:15:33,000 --> 01:15:33,833
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

1322
01:15:34,833 --> 01:15:37,708
<font size="20">Bakarrik egon nahi baduzu, itxi atea.</font>

1323
01:15:38,208 --> 01:15:40,208
<font size="20">Jendearekin egon nahi baduzu, ireki.</font>

1324
01:15:40,291 --> 01:15:42,125
<font size="20">Modu hoberik zoriontsu izateko?</font>

1325
01:15:42,208 --> 01:15:46,708
<font size="20">Oxfordeko ikasle-egoitza gogorarazten dit.
Janari hobea eta esnobismo gutxiagorekin.</font>

1326
01:15:48,666 --> 01:15:50,833
<font size="20">Hara. Bai, esan?</font>

1327
01:15:50,916 --> 01:15:53,208
<font size="20">Bai? A, sentitzen dut.</font>

1328
01:15:57,375 --> 01:15:58,458
<font size="20">Bai? Kaixo.</font>

1329
01:16:01,125 --> 01:16:01,958
<font size="20">Zer?</font>

1330
01:16:03,416 --> 01:16:04,500
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1331
01:16:04,583 --> 01:16:07,875
<font size="20">Entzun, ez hitzik esan, bale?
Lotu ezpainak.</font>

1332
01:16:07,958 --> 01:16:12,000
<font size="20">Nola edo hala konponduko dugu. Ixo.
Ez ezer esan, bale? Bale, agur.</font>

1333
01:16:13,958 --> 01:16:14,916
<font size="20">Jason zen.</font>

1334
01:16:16,250 --> 01:16:18,666
<font size="20">Tony Curranen hilketagatik atxilotu dute.</font>

1335
01:16:18,750 --> 01:16:19,875
<font size="20">O, Ron.</font>

1336
01:16:20,375 --> 01:16:21,375
<font size="20">Kaka zaharra.</font>

1337
01:16:22,833 --> 01:16:24,625
<font size="20">- Hemendik?
- Bai, hortik.</font>

1338
01:16:25,458 --> 01:16:28,083
<font size="20">Zure senarra, Stephen, ez dago ondo, ezta?</font>

1339
01:16:28,583 --> 01:16:30,291
<font size="20">Ez, ez dago ondo.</font>

1340
01:16:32,375 --> 01:16:34,125
<font size="20">Zerbait jarri diozu tean?</font>

1341
01:16:35,625 --> 01:16:36,458
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

1342
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:38,666
<font size="20">Lo egiten laguntzeko pilula.</font>

1343
01:16:39,708 --> 01:16:42,250
<font size="20">Bakar bat, gehiago hilgarria litzateke.</font>

1344
01:16:43,666 --> 01:16:46,416
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko
berarekin xakean jolasteagatik.</font>

1345
01:16:46,500 --> 01:16:48,166
<font size="20">Stephenek aspaldiko partez</font>

1346
01:16:48,250 --> 01:16:50,291
<font size="20">ez zuen beste inorekin jokatzen.</font>

1347
01:16:50,375 --> 01:16:51,625
<font size="20">A, jokalari ona da.</font>

1348
01:16:52,166 --> 01:16:55,041
<font size="20">- Zaila egin zait.
- Berriz etorriko zara?</font>

1349
01:16:55,125 --> 01:16:59,125
<font size="20">Bai, asko gustatuko litzaidake.
Hemen ez daukat lagun askorik.</font>

1350
01:16:59,208 --> 01:17:02,500
<font size="20">Kontuan izan Stephenek
egun onak eta txarrak dauzkala.</font>

1351
01:17:02,583 --> 01:17:05,541
<font size="20">- Egun ona izan du.
- Bueno, nire ama berdin dago.</font>

1352
01:17:06,041 --> 01:17:08,375
<font size="20">Ez nau beti gogoratzen.</font>

1353
01:17:10,166 --> 01:17:11,250
<font size="20">Oso gaixorik dago.</font>

1354
01:17:12,166 --> 01:17:15,541
<font size="20">Ez dakit zenbat gehiago…</font>

1355
01:17:16,958 --> 01:17:20,333
<font size="20">Sentitzen dut, Bogdan.
Bisitatzera joan beharko zinateke.</font>

1356
01:17:22,500 --> 01:17:26,500
<font size="20">Izugarri gustatuko litzaidake,
azken aldiz, baina ezin dut.</font>

1357
01:17:26,583 --> 01:17:27,833
<font size="20">Zergatik?</font>

1358
01:17:29,166 --> 01:17:31,500
<font size="20">Langileoi etortzen garenean</font>

1359
01:17:31,583 --> 01:17:34,958
<font size="20">pasaporteak kentzen dizkigutelako,
gordetzeko.</font>

1360
01:17:35,041 --> 01:17:37,791
<font size="20">Esan zuten lan honetan normala dela.</font>

1361
01:17:39,208 --> 01:17:40,333
<font size="20">Nortzuk esan zuten?</font>

1362
01:17:43,125 --> 01:17:45,708
<font size="20">Ez kezkatu. Moldatuko naiz.</font>

1363
01:17:47,958 --> 01:17:49,625
<font size="20">Tira, hemen gaude.</font>

1364
01:18:06,625 --> 01:18:09,791
<font size="20">Gorpuzkiak aurkitu dituzu hilobi batean.</font>

1365
01:18:09,875 --> 01:18:12,166
<font size="20">Zergatik da horren misteriotsua?</font>

1366
01:18:12,250 --> 01:18:13,416
<font size="20">Bada, Elizabeth,</font>

1367
01:18:15,000 --> 01:18:17,791
<font size="20">hezur horiek hilkutxa gainean daudelako.</font>

1368
01:18:27,083 --> 01:18:29,666
<font size="20">Eta zergatik zulatuko luke
inork hilobi bat</font>

1369
01:18:31,416 --> 01:18:33,625
<font size="20">hezurrak hezur gainean jartzeko?</font>

1370
01:18:34,250 --> 01:18:35,375
<font size="20">Gorpua ezkutatzeko.</font>

1371
01:18:39,291 --> 01:18:41,875
<font size="20">Beste hilketa bat omen dugu esku artean.</font>

1372
01:18:47,208 --> 01:18:48,208
<font size="20">Altxatu.</font>

1373
01:18:56,541 --> 01:18:59,791
<font size="20">- Eta hori kontatu dizu Elizabethek?
- Gutxi gorabehera.</font>

1374
01:19:02,500 --> 01:19:03,791
<font size="20">Bale, zatoz nirekin.</font>

1375
01:19:07,458 --> 01:19:08,291
<font size="20">Kax-kax.</font>

1376
01:19:09,291 --> 01:19:11,708
<font size="20">- Sar gaitezke?
- Sartu zarete jada.</font>

1377
01:19:11,791 --> 01:19:13,250
<font size="20">Tarta gehiago nahi duzu?</font>

1378
01:19:13,333 --> 01:19:16,250
<font size="20">Elizabeth, ez txantxetan hasi.
Hau serioa da.</font>

1379
01:19:17,166 --> 01:19:20,375
<font size="20">Jakin nahi dut zehatz-mehatz
nola aurkitu duzun gorpua.</font>

1380
01:19:20,875 --> 01:19:25,291
<font size="20">- Azaldu diot jada Donnari.
- Zuk zeuk kontatzea nahi dut.</font>

1381
01:19:25,375 --> 01:19:26,458
<font size="20">Bai, noski.</font>

1382
01:19:26,541 --> 01:19:30,750
<font size="20">Ba kontua da paseo bat ematera
atera nintzela, e, nartziso bila.</font>

1383
01:19:30,833 --> 01:19:32,083
<font size="20">Nartziso?</font>

1384
01:19:32,708 --> 01:19:35,916
<font size="20">- Lilipa-erraboilak leiho-ertzerako.
- Leiho-ertzerako?</font>

1385
01:19:36,000 --> 01:19:38,416
<font size="20">Bai, hurrengo udaberrian kolorea emateko.</font>

1386
01:19:38,500 --> 01:19:39,708
<font size="20">- Bai, noski.
- Bai.</font>

1387
01:19:39,791 --> 01:19:42,875
<font size="20">- Eta zulatzen ari nintzen eta…
- Nola, eskuekin?</font>

1388
01:19:42,958 --> 01:19:45,583
<font size="20">Eskuekin ez. Ez inozoa izan.
Palatxo batekin.</font>

1389
01:19:45,666 --> 01:19:49,083
<font size="20">- A ze tentela, palatxo bat.
- Bai, lorezaintza-palatxoa.</font>

1390
01:19:49,166 --> 01:19:51,625
<font size="20">- Noski.
- Orduan aurkitu nituen hezurrak.</font>

1391
01:19:51,708 --> 01:19:55,625
<font size="20">Oso harrigarria izan zen.
Berebiziko kointzidentzia.</font>

1392
01:19:59,875 --> 01:20:04,291
<font size="20">Pazientzia galtzen ari naiz
zurekin eta zure erretiratu-taldearekin.</font>

1393
01:20:04,375 --> 01:20:07,125
<font size="20">Aizu, nire semea zelda batean sartu duzu.</font>

1394
01:20:07,666 --> 01:20:10,250
<font size="20">Eta oraingoz froga guztiak
unean unekoak dira.</font>

1395
01:20:10,333 --> 01:20:14,041
<font size="20">Sentitzen dut, baina ez da nahikoa
norbaiti hilketa leporatzeko.</font>

1396
01:20:14,125 --> 01:20:16,166
<font size="20">Beraz, utzi gogorrarena egiteari</font>

1397
01:20:16,250 --> 01:20:18,208
<font size="20">eta zoaz benetako hiltzailea bilatzera.</font>

1398
01:20:18,291 --> 01:20:20,250
<font size="20">Pozez bilatuko nuke benetako hiltzailea.</font>

1399
01:20:20,333 --> 01:20:22,416
<font size="20">- Ondo.
- Izugarri gustatuko litzaidake.</font>

1400
01:20:22,500 --> 01:20:25,166
<font size="20">Beraz, "Astearteko Heriotza Elkartea"k</font>

1401
01:20:25,250 --> 01:20:27,208
<font size="20">kasua uzten badu bost minutuz,</font>

1402
01:20:27,291 --> 01:20:29,208
<font size="20">aurrerapenak izan genitzake.</font>

1403
01:20:29,291 --> 01:20:34,708
<font size="20">Auskalo,
afari-klubetan gera zintezkete, golfean,</font>

1404
01:20:34,791 --> 01:20:37,833
<font size="20">llamak elikatzen,
eta kolesterola kontrolatzen,</font>

1405
01:20:37,916 --> 01:20:40,250
<font size="20">eta utzi gainerakoa profesionaloi.</font>

1406
01:20:40,333 --> 01:20:42,125
<font size="20">Belarri gogora duzuenok,</font>

1407
01:20:42,208 --> 01:20:44,625
<font size="20">igo audifonoko bolumena.</font>

1408
01:20:44,708 --> 01:20:49,250
<font size="20">Polizia-lana debekatuta dago
polizia ez direnentzako.</font>

1409
01:20:50,250 --> 01:20:52,458
<font size="20">- Ulertzen?
- Bai, ulertuta.</font>

1410
01:20:52,958 --> 01:20:53,791
<font size="20">Bale.</font>

1411
01:20:55,583 --> 01:20:57,000
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1412
01:20:57,583 --> 01:20:58,416
<font size="20">De Freitas.</font>

1413
01:21:00,583 --> 01:21:02,875
<font size="20">Nik hezurrak aztertuko nituzke.</font>

1414
01:21:02,958 --> 01:21:04,666
<font size="20">- Garrantzitsua izan liteke.
- Ados.</font>

1415
01:22:01,166 --> 01:22:03,750
<font size="20">AZKEN ABISUA. EZ SUDURRA SARTU!</font>

1416
01:22:15,875 --> 01:22:16,708
<font size="20">E.</font>

1417
01:22:17,916 --> 01:22:19,083
<font size="20">A, kaixo.</font>

1418
01:22:19,166 --> 01:22:22,291
<font size="20">Entzun, ez nuke zurekin
hitz egin beharko, baina…</font>

1419
01:22:23,208 --> 01:22:26,916
<font size="20">Hilerrian aurkitu genituen
hezurrei buruzko berriak ditut.</font>

1420
01:22:27,000 --> 01:22:29,291
<font size="20">Peter Mercerren gorpuzkiak dira.</font>

1421
01:22:31,208 --> 01:22:32,041
<font size="20">Nola?</font>

1422
01:22:34,166 --> 01:22:36,125
<font size="20">Ama maitea, hori ustekabea.</font>

1423
01:22:38,666 --> 01:22:40,000
<font size="20">De Freitas agentea,</font>

1424
01:22:40,083 --> 01:22:43,333
<font size="20">hona Penny Gray inspektoreburua
eta bere senarra, John.</font>

1425
01:22:43,416 --> 01:22:45,000
<font size="20">- Urte askotarako.
- Kaixo.</font>

1426
01:22:45,083 --> 01:22:49,375
<font size="20">- Bere garaian ikusi ahal zenuen.
- Zirraragarria zen.</font>

1427
01:22:49,458 --> 01:22:50,583
<font size="20">Ohorea da, andrea.</font>

1428
01:22:51,666 --> 01:22:55,583
<font size="20">Penny, Donna agente gazte bikaina da.</font>

1429
01:22:57,583 --> 01:23:01,583
<font size="20">Bogdanek aurkitu zituen hezurrez
hitz egin dit.</font>

1430
01:23:01,666 --> 01:23:06,083
<font size="20">Peter Mercer izeneko gizon batenak dira.
Metalezko plaka dauka belaunean,</font>

1431
01:23:06,166 --> 01:23:08,583
<font size="20">baina 50 urte zeramatzan lurperatuta.</font>

1432
01:23:08,666 --> 01:23:12,750
<font size="20">Beraz, ez du loturarik
Venthamen hilketarekin?</font>

1433
01:23:12,833 --> 01:23:15,958
<font size="20">Ez, baina mutilek
bertako asko galdekatu dituzte</font>

1434
01:23:16,041 --> 01:23:18,166
<font size="20">eta kendu dituzte</font>

1435
01:23:18,250 --> 01:23:21,208
<font size="20">Bernard, Marjorie eta aita Mackie
susmagarrien zerrendatik.</font>

1436
01:23:22,125 --> 01:23:23,416
<font size="20">A, benetan?</font>

1437
01:23:25,125 --> 01:23:29,375
<font size="20">Bada, 70eko hamarkadan,
Penny eta biok hona gentozen mezara.</font>

1438
01:23:29,458 --> 01:23:30,333
<font size="20">A, bai?</font>

1439
01:23:30,416 --> 01:23:34,333
<font size="20">Mackie desberdina zen orduan.
Lasaiagoa agian.</font>

1440
01:23:34,416 --> 01:23:35,625
<font size="20">Zorionak, Donna.</font>

1441
01:23:36,666 --> 01:23:37,916
<font size="20">Entzun duzu, Penny?</font>

1442
01:23:38,416 --> 01:23:41,000
<font size="20">Zure ondareak darrai emakume honekin.</font>

1443
01:23:48,041 --> 01:23:52,333
<font size="20">Beraz, ez duzu gogoratzen
argazki hau atera izana?</font>

1444
01:23:52,416 --> 01:23:55,208
<font size="20">Esan dizut,
hainbat argazki ateratzen dizkidate.</font>

1445
01:23:55,291 --> 01:23:57,750
<font size="20">Zurekin bezala. Ez dakit zer nahi duzun.</font>

1446
01:23:57,833 --> 01:24:00,041
<font size="20">- Esango…
- Gelditzen saiatu naiz.</font>

1447
01:24:00,125 --> 01:24:02,083
<font size="20">- Ez… Ron?
- Eskerrik asko.</font>

1448
01:24:02,166 --> 01:24:04,458
<font size="20">- Aita?
- Zer zabiltza hemen?</font>

1449
01:24:04,541 --> 01:24:08,291
<font size="20">Eta ze arraio daramazu?
Traje horrekin ezkondu zinen?</font>

1450
01:24:08,375 --> 01:24:09,583
<font size="20">Bai, lagun, bai.</font>

1451
01:24:10,250 --> 01:24:11,416
<font size="20">Bitan, gainera.</font>

1452
01:24:11,500 --> 01:24:16,625
<font size="20">Entzun, Jasonek lege-ordezkaritza
eskubidea du, eta nik emango diot.</font>

1453
01:24:16,708 --> 01:24:18,208
<font size="20">Ez zara abokatua, Ron.</font>

1454
01:24:18,291 --> 01:24:22,000
<font size="20">Titulurik ez izan arren,
beharrezko trebakuntza daukat.</font>

1455
01:24:22,083 --> 01:24:25,166
<font size="20">Neure burua ordezkatzen nuen
zuen aurka nire garaian.</font>

1456
01:24:25,250 --> 01:24:26,291
<font size="20">Jainko maitea.</font>

1457
01:24:26,375 --> 01:24:28,208
<font size="20">Errugabe bat atxiki duzu,</font>

1458
01:24:28,291 --> 01:24:31,666
<font size="20">eta froga guztiak
unean unekoak dira askoz jota.</font>

1459
01:24:31,750 --> 01:24:33,875
<font size="20">Ez dauka zurigarririk, Ron.</font>

1460
01:24:33,958 --> 01:24:36,000
<font size="20">Neure burua aurkeztuko dut.</font>

1461
01:24:36,083 --> 01:24:37,041
<font size="20">Ibrahim!</font>

1462
01:24:37,125 --> 01:24:39,125
<font size="20">Jasonen abokatuak hemen egoteko</font>

1463
01:24:39,208 --> 01:24:41,750
<font size="20">eskatu dit ebaluazio psikiatrikorako.</font>

1464
01:24:41,833 --> 01:24:42,666
<font size="20">Ulertzen?</font>

1465
01:24:42,750 --> 01:24:45,250
<font size="20">- Estres handia pairatzen du.
- E?</font>

1466
01:24:45,333 --> 01:24:46,875
<font size="20">Eta TOEN ere.</font>

1467
01:24:46,958 --> 01:24:48,916
<font size="20">Ni gabe eginez gero,</font>

1468
01:24:49,583 --> 01:24:51,666
<font size="20">zabarkeria-kasua arriskatu zenezakete.</font>

1469
01:24:51,750 --> 01:24:54,083
<font size="20">- Tarta gogoko duzunez…
- Ez!</font>

1470
01:24:54,166 --> 01:24:56,000
<font size="20">…limoizko tarta egin dut.</font>

1471
01:24:56,083 --> 01:24:59,125
<font size="20">Lan garrantzitsua egiten duzue.
Energia behar duzue.</font>

1472
01:24:59,208 --> 01:25:00,333
<font size="20">Zati bana?</font>

1473
01:25:00,416 --> 01:25:02,833
<font size="20">Alde bulegotik edo atxilotuko zaituztet!</font>

1474
01:25:02,916 --> 01:25:06,291
<font size="20">E, nik dakidala, hau Erresuma Batua da.</font>

1475
01:25:06,375 --> 01:25:09,708
<font size="20">Eta Erresuma Batuan,
abokatua izateko eskubidea dago.</font>

1476
01:25:09,791 --> 01:25:12,083
<font size="20">Jasonek hiru aldiz
hitz egin zuen Ian Venthamekin</font>

1477
01:25:12,166 --> 01:25:13,875
<font size="20">Tony Curran hil aurretik.</font>

1478
01:25:13,958 --> 01:25:15,916
<font size="20">Mutikoa da! Beti telefonoarekin.</font>

1479
01:25:16,000 --> 01:25:18,041
<font size="20">Non zegoen Curran hil zutenean?</font>

1480
01:25:18,125 --> 01:25:22,041
<font size="20">Esan nahi ez izateak
erruduna dela sinetsarazten dit.</font>

1481
01:25:23,166 --> 01:25:24,083
<font size="20">Esan.</font>

1482
01:25:24,166 --> 01:25:25,166
<font size="20">Zer esan?</font>

1483
01:25:25,250 --> 01:25:27,875
<font size="20">- Esan non zeunden.
- Ez zaizu axola.</font>

1484
01:25:27,958 --> 01:25:30,541
<font size="20">- Ez zara abokatua?
- Orain zure aita naiz.</font>

1485
01:25:30,625 --> 01:25:33,500
<font size="20">Utzi tontakeriak eta esaiguzu</font>

1486
01:25:33,583 --> 01:25:36,250
<font size="20">non zeunden Curran hil zutenean.</font>

1487
01:25:36,333 --> 01:25:38,791
<font size="20">Eta etxera joango gara partidua ikustera.</font>

1488
01:25:38,875 --> 01:25:40,166
<font size="20">Tira, esan. Aurrera.</font>

1489
01:25:43,000 --> 01:25:45,083
<font size="20">Ian Venthamen emaztearekin nengoen.</font>

1490
01:25:46,541 --> 01:25:47,458
<font size="20">Gemma Ventham?</font>

1491
01:25:48,958 --> 01:25:50,750
<font size="20">- Guk, ba…
- Amodio-kontua?</font>

1492
01:25:51,416 --> 01:25:52,500
<font size="20">Ene, Jason.</font>

1493
01:25:55,000 --> 01:25:56,208
<font size="20">Hau baieztatuko du?</font>

1494
01:25:57,416 --> 01:26:00,250
<font size="20">Bai, sentitzen dut, aita.</font>

1495
01:26:00,333 --> 01:26:03,083
<font size="20">Lasai, seme.
Horrela ezagutu nuen zure ama.</font>

1496
01:26:03,166 --> 01:26:06,125
<font size="20">Hara, pozik zaude? Horra zurigarria.</font>

1497
01:26:06,833 --> 01:26:07,916
<font size="20">Frogatu dezakezu?</font>

1498
01:26:10,125 --> 01:26:13,291
<font size="20">Bai. Egia esan, bai.
Mugikorra har dezaket?</font>

1499
01:26:23,750 --> 01:26:28,125
<font size="20">Data eta ordua agertzen dira.
Gemmarekin ere baieztatu dezakezu.</font>

1500
01:26:29,458 --> 01:26:31,833
<font size="20">Horra hor, Hudson inspektoreburua.</font>

1501
01:26:31,916 --> 01:26:34,208
<font size="20">Ez dago errugabe bat atxikitzerik.</font>

1502
01:26:34,291 --> 01:26:37,333
<font size="20">Benetako hiltzailea bilatzeari
ekin beharko zenioke.</font>

1503
01:26:39,916 --> 01:26:40,750
<font size="20">Ospa.</font>

1504
01:26:41,958 --> 01:26:43,750
<font size="20">Ospa denok nire bulegotik!</font>

1505
01:26:43,833 --> 01:26:45,625
<font size="20">- Tarta utziko dut.
- Atera!</font>

1506
01:26:46,500 --> 01:26:49,166
<font size="20">- Mundiala zara.
- Ez horregatik, seme. Ibra…</font>

1507
01:26:49,250 --> 01:26:51,291
<font size="20">- Zu ere bai, De Freitas.
- Bai.</font>

1508
01:26:55,541 --> 01:26:58,208
<font size="20">ELIZABETH: BOBBY TANNER
BISITATU NAHI DUZU?</font>

1509
01:27:07,083 --> 01:27:10,208
<font size="20">- Ez nekien auto bat zenuenik.
- Erretiratze-oparia.</font>

1510
01:27:10,291 --> 01:27:12,416
<font size="20">MI6tik.</font>

1511
01:27:20,250 --> 01:27:22,666
<font size="20">Uste duzu Bobby Tanner hemen dagoela?</font>

1512
01:27:22,750 --> 01:27:24,541
<font size="20">Aspalditik bilatzen dugu.</font>

1513
01:27:24,625 --> 01:27:28,916
<font size="20">Ez nago guztiz ziur,
baina bihozkadak jarraitzen ditut.</font>

1514
01:27:29,000 --> 01:27:32,083
<font size="20">Batzuetan merezi du,
ikusiko duzu, gero eta gehiago.</font>

1515
01:27:32,166 --> 01:27:36,375
<font size="20">- Baina nola jakin duzu?
- Duela gutxi, loreak bidali zizkidaten.</font>

1516
01:27:36,458 --> 01:27:40,625
<font size="20">Lirioak, hiazintoak,
tulipak eta urrebotoiak.</font>

1517
01:27:40,708 --> 01:27:42,125
<font size="20">- A ze polita.
- Bai.</font>

1518
01:27:42,875 --> 01:27:46,875
<font size="20">Oso, baina txartel batekin zetozen,
sudurra ez sartzeko zioena,</font>

1519
01:27:46,958 --> 01:27:50,958
<font size="20">eta lore horiek elkarrekin jaso daitekeen
sorta toxikoena zen.</font>

1520
01:27:51,041 --> 01:27:52,750
<font size="20">Abisu argia izan zen.</font>

1521
01:27:53,291 --> 01:27:54,416
<font size="20">Itxaron.</font>

1522
01:27:54,500 --> 01:27:57,791
<font size="20">Uste duzu Coopers Chaseko
inbertsore-kontuarekin lotuta dagoela?</font>

1523
01:27:58,791 --> 01:28:00,416
<font size="20">Burua irakurtzen didazu.</font>

1524
01:28:01,708 --> 01:28:06,708
<font size="20">Loreak freskoak ziren, eta eskura emanda,
beraz, Coopers Chasetik gertukoak.</font>

1525
01:28:06,791 --> 01:28:09,291
<font size="20">- Gero txartela gogoratu nuen.
- Txartela?</font>

1526
01:28:09,375 --> 01:28:13,708
<font size="20">Mauden loreetan zegoela,
Tony Curranengatik. "B.T."k sinatu zuen</font>

1527
01:28:13,791 --> 01:28:17,333
<font size="20">eta txartelako diseinua
nirearen berdin-berdina zen.</font>

1528
01:28:18,958 --> 01:28:21,875
<font size="20">Oso bereizgarria da.
Interneten bilatu nuen.</font>

1529
01:28:22,500 --> 01:28:27,125
<font size="20">Thorny Blooms, Moretonen,
bertako arduraduna Derek Ward da.</font>

1530
01:28:28,166 --> 01:28:30,625
<font size="20">Bobby Tanner barruan dagoela uste duzu?</font>

1531
01:28:30,708 --> 01:28:31,541
<font size="20">Bai.</font>

1532
01:28:32,041 --> 01:28:32,958
<font size="20">Eta Derek Ward?</font>

1533
01:28:33,458 --> 01:28:37,708
<font size="20">Ez dut uste ikusiko dituzunik
Bobby Tanner eta Derek Ward</font>

1534
01:28:37,791 --> 01:28:39,375
<font size="20">gela berean aldi berean.</font>

1535
01:28:41,375 --> 01:28:43,833
<font size="20">Antza, atzamarrak mozten dizkie etsaiei.</font>

1536
01:28:44,750 --> 01:28:48,583
<font size="20">Ai, laztana. Askoz okerragoak ikusi ditut.</font>

1537
01:28:53,375 --> 01:28:55,583
<font size="20">Kaixo. Zertan lagun diezazueket?</font>

1538
01:28:56,083 --> 01:28:59,333
<font size="20">Kaixo. Ezkontza baterako
enkargu batengatik deitu dut.</font>

1539
01:28:59,416 --> 01:29:01,000
<font size="20">Derek Ward hemen dago?</font>

1540
01:29:01,791 --> 01:29:02,666
<font size="20">Behean.</font>

1541
01:29:18,625 --> 01:29:20,208
<font size="20">Alfila E6ra.</font>

1542
01:29:23,083 --> 01:29:25,166
<font size="20">Ze asmo daukazu, Bogdan?</font>

1543
01:29:25,666 --> 01:29:30,000
<font size="20">Jakin nahi baina asmatu behar dituzun
horietako bat da.</font>

1544
01:29:30,083 --> 01:29:31,208
<font size="20">Zuzen zaude.</font>

1545
01:29:32,833 --> 01:29:36,291
<font size="20">Egia esan,
beste galdera bat egin nahi dizut.</font>

1546
01:29:36,375 --> 01:29:38,833
<font size="20">- Egin diezazuket?
- Noski.</font>

1547
01:29:39,416 --> 01:29:43,541
<font size="20">Hil zuten lehen gizona, e, eraikitzailea.</font>

1548
01:29:43,625 --> 01:29:45,041
<font size="20">Zera…</font>

1549
01:29:45,750 --> 01:29:47,458
<font size="20">Ai ene, ez.</font>

1550
01:29:48,833 --> 01:29:50,250
<font size="20">Bere izena ahaztu dut.</font>

1551
01:29:50,875 --> 01:29:53,541
<font size="20">- Tony Curran.
- Horixe bera, hori da.</font>

1552
01:29:53,625 --> 01:29:56,041
<font size="20">Tira, entzun dudan guztiagatik,</font>

1553
01:29:57,250 --> 01:29:59,291
<font size="20">uste dut badakidala nork hil zuen.</font>

1554
01:30:13,541 --> 01:30:16,875
<font size="20">- Zertan lagun diezazueket?
- Neure burua aurkeztuko dut, Derek.</font>

1555
01:30:16,958 --> 01:30:20,958
<font size="20">Barka, Derek deituko dizut,
edo nahiago duzu Bobby?</font>

1556
01:30:22,583 --> 01:30:25,583
<font size="20">Elizabeth Best.
Ez nekien noiz etorriko zinen.</font>

1557
01:30:30,166 --> 01:30:32,625
<font size="20">Ian Ventham eta Tony Curran
hilarazi zenituen?</font>

1558
01:30:33,833 --> 01:30:35,041
<font size="20">Zuzena zara, gero.</font>

1559
01:30:36,250 --> 01:30:37,083
<font size="20">Egin zenuen?</font>

1560
01:30:37,750 --> 01:30:39,916
<font size="20">Coopers Chaseko akzio guztiak hartzeko?</font>

1561
01:30:41,416 --> 01:30:42,250
<font size="20">Ez, bihotzak.</font>

1562
01:30:42,333 --> 01:30:45,250
<font size="20">Ez nituen hilarazi. Baina nahi nuen, bai.</font>

1563
01:30:45,333 --> 01:30:48,250
<font size="20">Non zeunden
Tony Curran hil zuten momentuan?</font>

1564
01:30:48,333 --> 01:30:52,958
<font size="20">Dorchester Hotelean,
Khalil Al-Berro printzearen</font>

1565
01:30:53,041 --> 01:30:56,416
<font size="20">21. urtebetetze-festarako
loreak prestatzen.</font>

1566
01:30:56,500 --> 01:30:59,791
<font size="20">Gutxienez 200 lekukok baieztatu dezakete.</font>

1567
01:30:59,875 --> 01:31:01,250
<font size="20">Beraz, ez da estalkia?</font>

1568
01:31:03,208 --> 01:31:04,541
<font size="20">Lore-saltzailea zara?</font>

1569
01:31:05,125 --> 01:31:07,500
<font size="20">A, lore freskoak lantzea.</font>

1570
01:31:08,041 --> 01:31:09,041
<font size="20">Kimatzea.</font>

1571
01:31:09,625 --> 01:31:11,416
<font size="20">Neure grina bakarra da.</font>

1572
01:31:11,916 --> 01:31:13,916
<font size="20">Niri buruzko gauza zintzo bakarra.</font>

1573
01:31:15,208 --> 01:31:19,291
<font size="20">Gure informazioaren arabera,
orain Coopers Chaseko jabe bakarra zara.</font>

1574
01:31:19,375 --> 01:31:20,833
<font size="20">Zoritxarrez, bai.</font>

1575
01:31:21,708 --> 01:31:24,500
<font size="20">Ez dut inbertsio horretan
jarraitzeko interesik.</font>

1576
01:31:25,750 --> 01:31:27,958
<font size="20">Eta zer egingo duzu proiektuarekin?</font>

1577
01:31:29,000 --> 01:31:32,833
<font size="20">Lursaila saldu, ahalik eta azkarren,
ahalik eta garestien.</font>

1578
01:31:37,041 --> 01:31:40,541
<font size="20">Entzuten dut Elizabethek
hitz egiten didanean, Bogdan.</font>

1579
01:31:41,750 --> 01:31:43,500
<font size="20">Eta iruditzen zait</font>

1580
01:31:44,041 --> 01:31:47,125
<font size="20">egoera korapilatsuan zeundela, ezta?</font>

1581
01:31:47,875 --> 01:31:48,875
