<font size="20">Gaueko musua ematen.</font>

1759
01:43:46,875 --> 01:43:48,416
<font size="20">Baina ezin dut leheneratu.</font>

1760
01:43:50,708 --> 01:43:52,708
<font size="20">Ezin dut bere senera etorrarazi.</font>

1761
01:43:55,208 --> 01:43:57,041
<font size="20">Gauza bakar bat egin nezakeen.</font>

1762
01:43:58,583 --> 01:43:59,916
<font size="20">Babes zenezakeen.</font>

1763
01:44:03,750 --> 01:44:06,500
<font size="20">Eta azkenean,
hori ere ezin izan nuen egin.</font>

1764
01:44:12,125 --> 01:44:14,333
<font size="20">Poliziari kontatuko diozue, jakina.</font>

1765
01:44:16,166 --> 01:44:17,000
<font size="20">Mesedez…</font>

1766
01:44:18,666 --> 01:44:21,708
<font size="20">Denbora pixka bat
eman diezadakezu Pennyrekin?</font>

1767
01:44:23,375 --> 01:44:24,208
<font size="20">Lagun gisa.</font>

1768
01:44:24,916 --> 01:44:26,458
<font size="20">Poliziari deitu aurretik.</font>

1769
01:44:36,875 --> 01:44:37,708
<font size="20">Noski.</font>

1770
01:44:38,958 --> 01:44:41,666
<font size="20">Utziko zaituztegu azken agurrak emateko.</font>

1771
01:44:41,750 --> 01:44:42,583
<font size="20">Elkarrekin.</font>

1772
01:44:44,375 --> 01:44:45,208
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1773
01:44:50,875 --> 01:44:52,416
<font size="20">O, Pen.</font>

1774
01:44:53,541 --> 01:44:55,083
<font size="20">Zure falta sentituko dut.</font>

1775
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:01,333
<font size="20">Ondo lo egin, laztana.</font>

1776
01:45:03,875 --> 01:45:05,041
<font size="20">Hau abentura.</font>

1777
01:45:10,833 --> 01:45:15,958
<font size="20">OHK</font>

1778
01:45:20,625 --> 01:45:25,000
<font size="20">Ostegunetako Hilketen Klubak argitu zuen
Angela Hughesen kasu irekia.</font>

1779
01:45:25,625 --> 01:45:26,791
<font size="20">Zurizko emakumea.</font>

1780
01:45:30,458 --> 01:45:33,125
<font size="20">Bilatzen genituen erantzunak
aurkitu genituen.</font>

1781
01:45:34,916 --> 01:45:36,750
<font size="20">Baina merezi izan zuen kostuak?</font>

1782
01:45:38,166 --> 01:45:39,000
<font size="20">Minak?</font>

1783
01:45:41,000 --> 01:45:41,833
<font size="20">Galerak?</font>

1784
01:45:48,250 --> 01:45:49,750
<font size="20">Maitasunez eginda gaude.</font>

1785
01:45:50,708 --> 01:45:51,583
<font size="20">Zuek eta ni.</font>

1786
01:45:52,208 --> 01:45:53,833
<font size="20">Ez dago horren dudarik.</font>

1787
01:45:53,916 --> 01:45:57,208
<font size="20">Hemen bildutakoak ikustean,
maitasuna ikusten dut.</font>

1788
01:45:58,208 --> 01:45:59,916
<font size="20">Aitarena, semearekiko.</font>

1789
01:46:02,041 --> 01:46:03,875
<font size="20">Amarena, alabarekiko.</font>

1790
01:46:06,041 --> 01:46:08,541
<font size="20">Emaztearena, heltzen dion senarrarekiko.</font>

1791
01:46:09,666 --> 01:46:13,541
<font size="20">Eta adiskidetasunaren
maitasun ahaltsua ere bai.</font>

1792
01:46:15,083 --> 01:46:16,083
<font size="20">Adiskide berriak.</font>

1793
01:46:17,000 --> 01:46:18,333
<font size="20">Ustekabeko adiskideak.</font>

1794
01:46:18,833 --> 01:46:22,708
<font size="20">Honek sentiarazten dio gizon bati,
urtez noraezean ibili eta gero,</font>

1795
01:46:24,083 --> 01:46:25,666
<font size="20">bere lekua aurkitu duela.</font>

1796
01:46:26,875 --> 01:46:30,000
<font size="20">Batzuetan, pertsona onek
gauza txarrak egiten dituzte.</font>

1797
01:46:30,083 --> 01:46:32,208
<font size="20">Baina Johnek maitasunez jardun zuen.</font>

1798
01:46:34,333 --> 01:46:35,791
<font size="20">Penny maite zuelako.</font>

1799
01:46:37,041 --> 01:46:41,166
<font size="20">Eta bere maitasuna
denbora eta espazioaz harago doa,</font>

1800
01:46:41,958 --> 01:46:44,625
<font size="20">eta elkarrekin dantzatuko dute
izarren artean.</font>

1801
01:46:45,958 --> 01:46:47,208
<font size="20">Hutsunea izango dugu.</font>

1802
01:46:49,708 --> 01:46:51,916
<font size="20">Eta betiko gogoratuko ditugu.</font>

1803
01:46:59,875 --> 01:47:00,708
<font size="20">Ibrahim,</font>

1804
01:47:01,750 --> 01:47:03,916
<font size="20">gorespen-hitzaldi ederra egin duzu.</font>

1805
01:47:04,000 --> 01:47:06,291
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko ordezkatzeagatik.</font>

1806
01:47:06,375 --> 01:47:07,666
<font size="20">Noski, maitea.</font>

1807
01:47:08,875 --> 01:47:10,916
<font size="20">Ez nukeen esaldi bakar bat esango.</font>

1808
01:47:12,291 --> 01:47:13,166
<font size="20">Lasai.</font>

1809
01:47:14,750 --> 01:47:15,958
<font size="20">- Joyce?
- Bai?</font>

1810
01:47:18,708 --> 01:47:20,708
<font size="20">Hau zuretzat da.</font>

1811
01:47:25,125 --> 01:47:26,041
<font size="20">Pennyrena zen.</font>

1812
01:47:27,000 --> 01:47:28,916
<font size="20">Baina zuk izatea nahi dugu.</font>

1813
01:47:35,541 --> 01:47:38,166
<font size="20">Ongi etorri Ostegunetako Hilketen Klubera.</font>

1814
01:47:38,250 --> 01:47:39,083
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1815
01:47:39,166 --> 01:47:41,958
<font size="20">Pozten gara ofizialki taldean izateaz.</font>

1816
01:47:43,125 --> 01:47:45,333
<font size="20">Elkarrekin lan egiteko irrikaz gaude.</font>

1817
01:47:45,416 --> 01:47:47,916
<font size="20">- Eta ez ahaztu oinarrizkoena.
- Zer?</font>

1818
01:47:48,500 --> 01:47:50,541
<font size="20">Beti tarta ekartzea.</font>

1819
01:47:53,625 --> 01:47:54,625
<font size="20">Joanna, begira.</font>

1820
01:47:55,291 --> 01:47:57,291
<font size="20">Kide ofizial izendatu naute.</font>

1821
01:47:58,125 --> 01:47:59,583
<font size="20">Zorionak, ama.</font>

1822
01:48:01,666 --> 01:48:04,833
<font size="20">Gogoan duzu hona aldatzea
akatsa zela esan nizunean?</font>

1823
01:48:06,083 --> 01:48:06,958
<font size="20">Oker nengoen.</font>

1824
01:48:07,791 --> 01:48:09,500
<font size="20">Hara, lehendabiziko aldia.</font>

1825
01:48:11,666 --> 01:48:14,125
<font size="20">Aita hil eta gero pozik zaude berriz.</font>

1826
01:48:14,958 --> 01:48:16,708
<font size="20">Eta Elizabethi esker da.</font>

1827
01:48:17,333 --> 01:48:18,166
<font size="20">Roni esker.</font>

1828
01:48:19,000 --> 01:48:19,916
<font size="20">Ibrahimi esker.</font>

1829
01:48:20,625 --> 01:48:22,583
<font size="20">Eta Coopers Chasei esker.</font>

1830
01:48:23,500 --> 01:48:25,791
<font size="20">Eta zergatik ez duzu erosten?</font>

1831
01:48:25,875 --> 01:48:28,833
<font size="20">- Barkatu?
- Salgai omen dago.</font>

1832
01:48:29,541 --> 01:48:31,458
<font size="20">- Nork saltzen du?
- Lore-saltzaile batek.</font>

1833
01:48:32,333 --> 01:48:33,541
<font size="20">Zer deritzozu?</font>

1834
01:48:35,208 --> 01:48:36,833
<font size="20">Geure etxean gera gintezke.</font>

1835
01:48:38,875 --> 01:48:40,791
<font size="20">Oso proposamen interesgarria da.</font>

1836
01:48:42,416 --> 01:48:43,541
<font size="20">Hitz egin dezagun.</font>

1837
01:48:44,500 --> 01:48:45,791
<font size="20">O, Joanna.</font>

1838
01:48:46,333 --> 01:48:47,208
<font size="20">Ama.</font>

1839
01:48:52,375 --> 01:48:53,208
<font size="20">Eskerrik asko.</font>

1840
01:49:04,458 --> 01:49:08,333
<font size="20">- Urteurren zoriontsua, maitea.
- Zorionak. Beste urte bati.</font>

1841
01:49:15,791 --> 01:49:16,916
<font size="20">Dantzatu nahi duzu?</font>

1842
01:49:17,625 --> 01:49:19,833
<font size="20">- Zergatik ez?
- Dantza dezagun.</font>

1843
01:49:20,875 --> 01:49:23,083
<font size="20">Bizitza laburregia da ez dantzatzeko.</font>

1844
01:49:53,041 --> 01:49:56,666
<font size="20">Adi. Zatoz hona hau ikustera.</font>

1845
01:49:56,750 --> 01:49:58,291
<font size="20">Zer esango dizut, ba?</font>

1846
01:49:59,416 --> 01:50:01,416
<font size="20">- Tori.
- Topa.</font>

1847
01:50:02,250 --> 01:50:04,750
<font size="20">- Begira.
- Segundo bakarrean egin du.</font>

1848
01:50:05,500 --> 01:50:06,458
<font size="20">Jainko maitea.</font>

1849
01:50:06,541 --> 01:50:09,833
<font size="20">- Ez du aukerarik. Topa, aita.
- Topa.</font>

1850
01:50:10,833 --> 01:50:14,375
<font size="20">Marko zaharkituak.
Oso gaztea nintzen ezkondu nintzenean.</font>

1851
01:50:14,458 --> 01:50:16,541
<font size="20">Ez dut uste Joanna ezkonduko denik.</font>

1852
01:50:17,125 --> 01:50:20,666
<font size="20">Gerry urduri-urduri zegoen,
baina oso jatorra zen.</font>

1853
01:50:28,166 --> 01:50:31,333
<font size="20">Hara, Ibrahim, zeu zara?</font>

1854
01:50:32,708 --> 01:50:35,708
<font size="20">- Zenbat urte zenituen?
- 22 eta ilea.</font>

1855
01:50:37,166 --> 01:50:38,583
<font size="20">Baina galanta oraindik.</font>

1856
01:57:45,541 --> 01:57:50,541
<font size="20">Azpitituluak: Naiara Bitorika</font>

